msgid "# RFork Guide"
msgstr "# RFork 指南"

msgid ""
"This guide explains how to use **RFork** as a model-loader plugin in **vLLM "
"Ascend**."
msgstr "本指南说明如何在 **vLLM Ascend** 中将 **RFork** 用作模型加载器插件。"

msgid "## Usage"
msgstr "## 使用方法"

msgid "### RFork Prerequisites"
msgstr "### RFork 前提条件"

msgid ""
"- Install the runtime dependency `YuanRong TransferEngine` on every RFork instance.\n"
"- Run a planner service that implements the RFork seed protocol. A simple mock planner script is provided at [`rfork_planner.py`](https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm-ascend/blob/main/examples/rfork/rfork_planner.py)."
msgstr ""
"- 在每个 RFork 实例上安装运行时依赖 `YuanRong TransferEngine`。\n"
"- 运行一个实现 RFork seed 协议的规划器服务。一个简单的模拟规划器脚本位于 [`rfork_planner.py`](https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm-ascend/blob/main/examples/rfork/rfork_planner.py)。"

msgid "### Configuration Fields"
msgstr "### 配置字段"

msgid "### Planner Responsibilities"
msgstr "### 规划器职责"

msgid ""
"The planner treats the seed key as an opaque compatibility identifier. RFork"
" derives it from the model/configuration fingerprint, the structural digest "
"of transferable tensors, and shard topology. A planner should:"
msgstr "规划器将 seed 键视为不透明的兼容性标识符。RFork 根据模型/配置指纹、可传输张量的结构摘要和分片拓扑生成该键。规划器应："

msgid ""
"- Match exact seed keys, track seed availability through heartbeats, and expire stale advertisements according to the planner's configured policy.\n"
"- Allocate leases according to seed capacity and accept lease releases. A planner that advertises `LEASE_TTL_SEC` can additionally reclaim abandoned or expired leases; a legacy planner without that header must provide its own operational recovery for failed releases.\n"
"- Make seed selection and lease state observable for operations."
msgstr ""
"- 按 seed 键精确匹配，通过心跳跟踪 seed 可用性，并根据规划器配置的策略清理过期的 seed 广告。\n"
"- 根据 seed 容量分配租约并接受租约释放。声明 `LEASE_TTL_SEC` 的规划器还可以回收遗留或已过期的租约；没有该响应头的旧版规划器必须自行提供失败释放的运维恢复机制。\n"
"- 提供 seed 选择和租约状态的可观测信息，便于运维。"

msgid ""
"Lease release is asynchronous. An unresolved release delays advertising the "
"receiver as a seed, but does not block inference. The bundled planner is a "
"functional example, not a production scheduler."
msgstr "租约释放以异步方式进行。尚未解决的释放会延迟将接收端发布为 seed，但不会阻塞推理。随附的规划器是功能示例，并非生产级规划器。"

msgid "## Supported Models"
msgstr "## 支持的模型"

msgid "## Performance Considerations"
msgstr "## 性能注意事项"

msgid ""
"RFork indexes tensor address ranges to find backing allocations and uses "
"binary search for memory-coverage checks during registration. Registration "
"still adds seed startup cost, so RFork is most beneficial when later "
"replicas reuse a seed rather than for a single cold start."
msgstr ""
"RFork 为张量地址范围建立索引以查找底层分配，并在注册期间使用二分查找检查内存覆盖情况。注册仍会增加 seed 的启动开销，因此 RFork "
"更适用于后续副本复用 seed，而非单次冷启动。"

msgid ""
"Performance depends on model size, shard topology, NPU tensor layout, "
"TransferEngine registration time, network bandwidth, and the number of "
"concurrent destinations. Compare with the default loader using:"
msgstr ""
"性能取决于模型大小、分片拓扑、NPU 张量布局、TransferEngine 注册时间、网络带宽和并发目标端数量。可使用以下指标与默认加载器进行比较："

msgid ""
"- Time from process start until the service is ready.\n"
"- Registration, metadata, and read timings in the DEBUG `RFork transfer stages` log, plus bytes and throughput in `RFork weight transfer completed` (INFO on TP rank 0, DEBUG on other ranks).\n"
"- Seed inference latency and storage/host-memory traffic while transfers are active.\n"
"- Seed hit rate, transfer failure rate, and fallback rate."
msgstr ""
"- 从进程启动到服务就绪的耗时。\n"
"- DEBUG 级别 `RFork transfer stages` 日志中的注册、元数据和读取耗时，以及 `RFork weight transfer completed` 中的传输字节数和吞吐量（TP rank 0 为 INFO，其他 rank 为 DEBUG）。\n"
"- 传输期间 seed 的推理延迟以及存储/主机内存流量。\n"
"- seed 命中率、传输失败率和回退率。"

msgid "## Example Commands & Placeholders"
msgstr "## 示例命令与占位符"

msgid "> Replace parts in `<...>` before running."
msgstr "> 运行前替换 `<...>` 中的部分。"

msgid "### 1. Install YuanRong Datasystem"
msgstr "### 1. 安装 YuanRong Datasystem"

msgid "### 2. Start the Planner"
msgstr "### 2. 启动规划器"

msgid ""
"A simple planner implementation is provided at "
"[`rfork_planner.py`](https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm-"
"ascend/blob/main/examples/rfork/rfork_planner.py)."
msgstr ""
"一个简单的规划器实现位于 [`rfork_planner.py`](https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm-"
"ascend/blob/main/examples/rfork/rfork_planner.py)。"

msgid "### 3. Start vLLM Instances"
msgstr "### 3. 启动 vLLM 实例"

msgid ""
"Use the same RFork startup command for both the first instance and later "
"instances in the same deployment."
msgstr "对同一部署中的第一个实例和后续实例使用相同的 RFork 启动命令。"

msgid ""
"For the first instance, the planner usually has no compatible seed yet, so "
"RFork falls back to the default loader. After loading finishes, the instance"
" can publish a local seed service and report itself to the planner."
msgstr ""
"对于第一个实例，规划器通常还没有兼容的 seed，因此 RFork 会回退到默认加载器。加载完成后，该实例可以发布本地 seed "
"服务，并向规划器报告自身。"

msgid "### Placeholder Descriptions"
msgstr "### 占位符说明"

msgid ""
"- `<model_path>`: Model path or model identifier passed to `vllm serve`.\n"
"- `<served_model_name>`: Service name exposed by vLLM.\n"
"- `<planner_ip>`: IP address or hostname of the RFork planner.\n"
"- `<planner_port>`: Listening port of the RFork planner.\n"
"- `<model_url>`: Stable model identity string used to build the RFork seed key.\n"
"- `<deploy_strategy>`: Stable deployment-strategy name used to build the RFork seed key.\n"
"- `<port>`: Serving port of the vLLM instance being started."
msgstr ""
"- `<model_path>`: 传递给 `vllm serve` 的模型路径或模型标识符。\n"
"- `<served_model_name>`: vLLM 暴露的服务名称。\n"
"- `<planner_ip>`: RFork 规划器的 IP 地址或主机名。\n"
"- `<planner_port>`: RFork 规划器的监听端口。\n"
"- `<model_url>`: 用于构建 RFork seed 键的稳定模型标识字符串。\n"
"- `<deploy_strategy>`: 用于构建 RFork seed 键的稳定部署策略名称。\n"
"- `<port>`: 正在启动的 vLLM 实例的服务端口。"

msgid "## Overview"
msgstr "## 概述"

msgid ""
"RFork is a warm-start weight loading path for vLLM Ascend. Instead of always"
" reading model weights from storage, a new instance can request a compatible"
" **seed** instance from an external planner, then pull weights directly from"
" that seed through `YuanRong TransferEngine`."
msgstr ""
"RFork 是 vLLM Ascend 的一种热启动权重加载路径。新实例无需始终从存储中读取模型权重，而是可以向外部规划器请求一个兼容的 **种子** "
"实例，然后通过 `YuanRong TransferEngine` 直接从该种子实例拉取权重。"

msgid "The RFork loading flow in the current implementation is:"
msgstr "当前实现中的 RFork 加载流程如下："

msgid "## Application Scenarios"
msgstr "## 应用场景"

msgid "| Field Name | Type | Description | Allowed Values / Notes |"
msgstr "| 字段名 | 类型 | 描述 | 允许值 / 备注 |"

msgid ""
"- **Scale-out after a first successful load**: The first instance may still load from storage, but later instances with the same deployment identity can reuse it as a seed and shorten startup time.\n"
"- **Elastic serving clusters**: Because RFork asks a planner for available seeds, it fits clusters where instances are created and reclaimed dynamically.\n"
"- **Topology-sensitive deployments**: RFork derives the seed key from a configuration fingerprint, a structural digest of the built model's transferable tensors, and the shard topology (`tp_rank`, optional `pp_rank`, optional `ep_rank`, an optional `sharded_dp_rank`, and an optional `draft` marker), so only structure- and topology-compatible instances are matched together."
msgstr ""
"- **首次成功加载后的横向扩容**：第一个实例仍可能从存储加载，但后续具有相同部署标识的实例可以将其作为种子复用，从而缩短启动时间。\n"
"- **弹性服务集群**：由于 RFork 会向规划器询问可用的种子，因此适用于实例动态创建和回收的集群。\n"
"- **拓扑敏感型部署**：RFork 从配置指纹、已构建模型可传输张量的结构摘要以及分片拓扑（`tp_rank`、可选的 `pp_rank`、可选的 `ep_rank`、可选的 `sharded_dp_rank`，以及可选的 `draft` 标记）派生 seed 键，因此只有结构和拓扑兼容的实例才会被匹配在一起。"

msgid ""
"| **rfork_model_identity_headers** | Boolean | Attach readable model "
"identity headers to every planner request. | Optional. Default: `false`. "
"Explicit JSON `true` or `false` overrides `RFORK_MODEL_IDENTITY_HEADERS`; "
"otherwise the environment variable accepts `0`, `1`, `true`, or `false`, "
"ignoring case and surrounding whitespace. |"
msgstr ""
"| **rfork_model_identity_headers** | 布尔值 | 为每个规划器请求附加可读的模型身份请求头。 | "
"可选。默认值：`false`。显式 JSON `true` 或 `false` 会覆盖 "
"`RFORK_MODEL_IDENTITY_HEADERS`；否则环境变量接受 `0`、`1`、`true` 或 `false`，忽略大小写和首尾空白。"
" |"

msgid ""
"| **rfork_heartbeat_interval_sec** | Number | Interval between planner "
"heartbeat reports. | Optional. Default: `30.0`. JSON configuration only. "
"Must be a finite positive number; invalid values fail configuration "
"initialization. |"
msgstr ""
"| **rfork_heartbeat_interval_sec** | 数字 | 规划器心跳上报的间隔时间。 | 可选。默认值：`30.0`。仅支持 "
"JSON 配置。必须是有限的正数；无效值会导致配置初始化失败。 |"

msgid ""
"| **rfork_lease_release_max_attempts** | Integer | Fast-attempt count before"
" transient lease-release failures continue at a slower background interval. "
"| Optional. Default: `3`. JSON configuration only. Must be a positive "
"integer; invalid values fail configuration initialization. Permanent planner"
" rejection still stops retries. |"
msgstr ""
"| **rfork_lease_release_max_attempts** | 整数 | 在瞬时租约释放失败转为较慢的后台间隔重试之前的快速尝试次数。"
" | 可选。默认值：`3`。仅支持 JSON 配置。必须是正整数；无效值会导致配置初始化失败。规划器的永久性拒绝仍会停止重试。 |"

msgid ""
"| **rfork_lease_release_retry_interval_sec** | Number | Interval between "
"fast lease-release retries. | Optional. Default: `30.0`. JSON configuration "
"only. Must be a finite positive number; invalid values fail configuration "
"initialization. |"
msgstr ""
"| **rfork_lease_release_retry_interval_sec** | 数字 | 快速租约释放重试之间的间隔时间。 | "
"可选。默认值：`30.0`。仅支持 JSON 配置。必须是有限的正数；无效值会导致配置初始化失败。 |"

msgid ""
"| **rfork_seed_removal_supported** | Boolean or `null` | Whether the planner"
" implements the optional `/remove_seed` and draining contract. | Optional. "
"JSON configuration only. If omitted, defaults to `false` (skip removal). "
"Explicit `true` requires the administrator to confirm that `200` means "
"removed, `409` means draining, and `404` means that the seed record is "
"absent. `false` skips removal, and `null` enables auto-detection. In auto "
"mode, only `200` or `409` confirms support; an unknown `404` is not treated "
"as successful removal, and `405` or `501` means unsupported. |"
msgstr ""
"| **rfork_seed_removal_supported** | 布尔值或 `null` | 规划器是否实现可选的 `/remove_seed`"
" 和 draining 协议。 | 可选。仅支持 JSON 配置。未提供时默认为 `false`（跳过删除）。显式 `true` 要求管理员确认 "
"`200` 表示已删除、`409` 表示正在 draining、`404` 表示 seed 记录不存在。`false` 跳过删除，`null` "
"启用自动检测。自动模式下，只有收到 `200` 或 `409` 才确认接口受支持；未知含义的 `404` 不视为删除成功，`405` 或 `501` "
"表示不支持。 |"

msgid ""
"| **rfork_seed_port_base** | Integer | Base port for deterministic seed HTTP"
" endpoints. | Optional. Default: `0`, which lets the OS assign a port. JSON "
"configuration only. The base must be an integer in `[0, 65535]`; invalid "
"values fail configuration initialization. For a nonzero base, main and draft"
" models reserve adjacent slots per worker: main uses `base + 2 * "
"global_rank`, draft uses `base + 2 * global_rank + 1`. If the calculated "
"port exceeds `65535` or is already in use, the seed service falls back to OS"
" assignment. Keep this range separate from TransferEngine, its HIXL endpoint"
" range, and other service ports. |"
msgstr ""
"| **rfork_seed_port_base** | 整数 | 确定性种子 HTTP 端点的基准端口。 | "
"可选。默认值：`0`，表示由操作系统分配端口。仅支持 JSON 配置。基准端口必须是 `[0, 65535]` "
"范围内的整数；无效值会导致配置初始化失败。对于非零基准值，主模型和 draft 模型为每个 worker 预留相邻槽位：主模型使用 `base + 2 "
"* global_rank`，draft 使用 `base + 2 * global_rank + 1`。如果计算出的端口超过 `65535` "
"或已被占用，seed 服务会回退到由操作系统分配。请将此范围与 TransferEngine、其 HIXL 端点范围以及其他服务端口分开。 |"

msgid ""
"RFork does not match instances by `model_url` alone. The local seed key is "
"derived from three layers:"
msgstr "RFork 并非仅通过 `model_url` 匹配实例。本地 seed 键由三个层次派生："

msgid ""
"- a **compatibility fingerprint** over value-semantic configuration,\n"
"- a **structural digest** over the built model's transferable tensors, and\n"
"- the **shard topology**: `tp_rank`, optional `pp_rank`, optional `ep_rank`, a conditional `sharded_dp_rank`, and an optional `draft` marker."
msgstr ""
"- 基于值语义配置的**兼容性指纹**，\n"
"- 基于已构建模型可传输张量的**结构摘要**，以及\n"
"- **分片拓扑**：`tp_rank`、可选的 `pp_rank`、可选的 `ep_rank`、条件性的 `sharded_dp_rank`，以及可选的 `draft` 标记。"

msgid ""
"The compatibility fingerprint covers configuration that changes tensor "
"*contents* without changing tensor *shapes*: the RFork protocol version, "
"`model_url`, `model_deploy_strategy_name`, the resolved model revision, the "
"checkpoint quantization config digest, the architecture list, RoPE settings,"
" the effective P/D role (`kv_role`), and `mix_placement`."
msgstr ""
"兼容性指纹涵盖那些改变张量*内容*但不改变张量*形状*的配置：RFork "
"协议版本、`model_url`、`model_deploy_strategy_name`、解析后的模型版本、checkpoint "
"量化配置摘要、架构列表、RoPE 设置、生效的 P/D 角色（`kv_role`）以及 `mix_placement`。"

msgid ""
"The structural digest is computed from the same transferable tensor "
"inventory the transfer manifest validates: stable tensor IDs, shapes, "
"dtypes, and NPU formats. Any setting that changes tensor structure is "
"captured automatically, including weight dtype, TP/PP/EP sharding, NZ and "
"fused MC2 layout switches, quantization post-processing, and speculative "
"draft topology."
msgstr ""
"结构摘要基于传输清单所校验的同一份可传输张量清单计算，包括稳定的张量 ID、形状、dtype 和 NPU "
"格式。任何改变张量结构的设置都会被自动捕获，包括权重 dtype、TP/PP/EP 分片、NZ 和融合 MC2 布局开关、量化后处理及投机草稿模型拓扑。"

msgid ""
"Tensor IDs are readable canonical paths such as "
"`layers.0.self_attn.impl.scales[\"w\"]`. Registered parameters and buffers "
"are named first through module registration edges, so their module paths "
"stay canonical even when an implementation object exposes a shorter alias. "
"Remaining tensors take the shortest path through supported tensor "
"attributes, choosing the smallest path when several have the same length. "
"Container keys use typed labels (strings are quoted, while integers, floats,"
" booleans, `None`, dtypes, and tuples of these are tagged; ordinary Enum "
"members use their canonical member names (aliases share that name), while "
"Flag and IntFlag members use their integer values), and collection rejects "
"any other key type, as well as distinct entries of one container that share "
"a label, instead of guessing. IDs do not contain memory addresses and are "
"independent of attribute insertion order. Exact aliases of the same tensor "
"range are deduplicated, while distinct storage views remain separate "
"entries. Seed and receiver must have compatible tensor and alias graphs."
msgstr ""
"张量 ID 是可读的规范路径，例如 "
"`layers.0.self_attn.impl.scales[\"w\"]`。已注册的参数和缓冲区会先通过模块注册边命名，因此即使实现对象暴露了更短的别名，它们的模块路径仍是规范名称。其余张量取经过受支持张量属性的最短路径；长度相同时取路径字典序最小者。容器键使用带类型的标签（字符串加引号，整数、浮点数、布尔值、`None`、dtype"
" 及由它们组成的元组带类型标记；普通 Enum 成员使用其规范成员名（别名共享该名称），Flag 和 IntFlag "
"成员使用其整数值），其他类型的键，以及同一容器中标签相同的不同条目，都会直接报错而不是猜测标签。ID "
"不包含内存地址，也不受属性插入顺序影响。同一张量范围的完全相同别名会被去重，不同存储视图仍保留为独立条目。seed "
"和接收端必须具有兼容的张量及别名关系图。"

msgid ""
"Shard ranks distinguish same-shaped shards: `tp_rank` picks the TP slice, "
"`pp_rank` the pipeline stage, `ep_rank` the expert set (expert weights are "
"same-shaped across EP ranks), and `sharded_dp_rank` the DP position — but "
"only when weight content is actually sharded across the DP dimension. Two "
"deployment forms break DP replication: fine-grained TP "
"(`finegrained_tp_config`) shards selected modules across the DP dimension, "
"and MoE models with `data_parallel_size > 1` shard expert weights across the"
" DP×TP plane — with or without expert parallelism enabled, since with EP off"
" the DP position is the only thing distinguishing same-shaped different-"
"content expert shards. In those cases the DP rank joins the seed key as a "
"shard selector; replicated DP ranks leave it unset and keep sharing one seed"
" pool."
msgstr ""
"分片 rank 用于区分形状相同的分片：`tp_rank` 选择 TP 切片，`pp_rank` 选择流水线阶段，`ep_rank` "
"选择专家集合（专家权重在各 EP rank 之间形状相同），`sharded_dp_rank` 选择 DP 位置——但仅当权重内容确实沿 DP "
"维度分片时才如此。有两种部署形式会打破 DP 复制：细粒度 TP（`finegrained_tp_config`）将选定模块沿 DP 维度分片，以及 "
"`data_parallel_size > 1` 的 MoE 模型将专家权重沿 DP×TP 平面分片——无论是否启用专家并行，因为在 EP 关闭时，DP"
" 位置是区分形状相同但内容不同的专家分片的唯一依据。在这些情况下，DP rank 作为分片选择器加入 seed 键；复制的 DP rank "
"则不设置它，并继续共享同一个种子池。"

msgid ""
"This means two instances must agree on model identity, tensor structure, and deployment topology before the planner will treat them as interchangeable seeds.\n"
"The final manifest is still validated before transfer, and RFork falls back rather than copying incompatible tensors."
msgstr ""
"这意味着两个实例必须在模型标识、张量结构和部署拓扑上达成一致，规划器才会将它们视为可互换的种子。\n"
"最终清单在传输前仍会经过校验，RFork 会回退而不是复制不兼容的张量。"

msgid ""
"Successful loads log `source=transfer`, `local`, `fallback`, or `shared_target`.\n"
"Successful TP0 weight reads also log transfer elapsed time, bytes, chunks, and\n"
"throughput at INFO; other TP ranks and per-chunk timings remain at DEBUG.\n"
"Every successful registration, receiver-before-read, and final receiver stage\n"
"emits one bounded `RFork tensor layout summary` at INFO per rank. The summary hashes all\n"
"tensor IDs, shapes, strides, dtypes, NPU formats, logical byte counts, storage byte\n"
"capacities, storage offsets, and NPU descriptor element counts into fixed-size\n"
"semantic and physical digests. It also reports aggregate counts and at most\n"
"three representative tensors, preferring storage views or tensors whose NPU\n"
"descriptor size differs from logical `numel`. Match a receiver's `peer_session`\n"
"to the seed's `session`. Digest differences are diagnostic and do not by\n"
"themselves reject a transfer. On checkpoint-layout transfers, compare\n"
"`receiver_before_read` with `receiver_after_post_load` to determine whether the\n"
"post-load hook rebuilt the layout. Processed-layout transfers instead emit\n"
"`receiver_after_transfer_finalize`, because their layout processing happened\n"
"before the read. The summary does not copy tensor data or prove value equality;\n"
"validate output accuracy separately on NPU hardware.\n"
"Set `VLLM_LOGGING_LEVEL=DEBUG` for per-rank registration, metadata, transfer,\n"
"lease-release, and publication timing."
msgstr ""
"成功加载会记录 `source=transfer`、`local`、`fallback` 或 `shared_target`。\n"
"成功的 TP0 权重读取还会在 INFO 级别记录传输耗时、字节数、分块数和\n"
"吞吐量；其他 TP rank 和每个分块的耗时仍保持在 DEBUG 级别。\n"
"每次成功注册、读取前接收端以及最终接收端阶段\n"
"都会在每个 rank 的 INFO 级别输出一条有界的 `RFork tensor layout summary`。该摘要会将所有张量\n"
"ID、形状、stride、dtype、NPU 格式、逻辑字节数、存储字节\n"
"容量、存储偏移和 NPU 描述符元素数量哈希为固定大小的\n"
"语义和物理摘要。它还会报告聚合计数以及至多\n"
"三个代表性张量，优先选择存储视图或 NPU\n"
"描述符大小与逻辑 `numel` 不同的张量。将接收端的 `peer_session`\n"
"与种子的 `session` 匹配。摘要差异是诊断信息，其本身\n"
"不会拒绝传输。在 checkpoint 布局传输中，比较\n"
"`receiver_before_read` 与 `receiver_after_post_load` 以确定\n"
"加载后钩子是否重建了布局。处理后的布局传输则输出\n"
"`receiver_after_transfer_finalize`，因为其布局处理发生在\n"
"读取之前。该摘要不会复制张量数据，也不证明值相等；\n"
"请在 NPU 硬件上单独验证输出准确性。\n"
"设置 `VLLM_LOGGING_LEVEL=DEBUG` 以获取每个 rank 的注册、元数据、传输、\n"
"租约释放和发布时序信息。"

msgid ""
"For processed-layout transfers, RFork reuses the full registration inventory"
" to compute the initial structural digest and reuses the final post-eval "
"layout digest for immediate seed publication. Deferred publication scans the"
" live model again; a structural mismatch prevents publication. Checkpoint-"
"layout processing rebuilds memory registration and the transfer manifest "
"after post-load processing, while retaining the initially bound digest and "
"seed key without a publication-time digest check. This allows compatible "
"post-load reshapes to keep the receiver's original lookup identity. Tensor "
"names, element counts, dtypes, and NPU formats are still validated against "
"the seed manifest before transfer."
msgstr ""
"对于处理后布局的传输，RFork 复用完整的注册张量清单计算初始结构摘要，并复用模型进入 eval 模式后的最终布局摘要立即发布 "
"seed。延迟发布时会再次扫描当前模型；结构不匹配时禁止发布。检查点布局在后处理后重新注册内存并更新传输清单，但保留首次绑定的摘要和 seed "
"键，不进行发布时的摘要检查。这使兼容的后处理 reshape 能够保留接收端原始查询身份。传输前仍会按照 seed "
"清单校验张量名称、元素数量、dtype 和 NPU 格式。"

msgid ""
"If model construction fails before returning a complete model with Engram CPU\n"
"offload enabled, RFork stops instead of retrying through the default loader.\n"
"Partially constructed host tables cannot be safely released through the model;\n"
"fix the initialization error and restart the worker."
msgstr ""
"如果启用 Engram CPU 卸载的模型构造在返回完整模型前失败，RFork "
"会停止，而不是通过默认加载器重试。无法通过模型安全释放部分构造的主机表；请修复初始化错误并重启 worker。"

msgid ""
"For later instances, RFork tries to transfer weights when the planner "
"allocates a compatible seed. A seed miss or transfer failure triggers "
"fallback subject to cleanup and the constraints described below."
msgstr ""
"对于后续实例，当规划器分配了兼容的 seed 时，RFork 会尝试传输权重。seed "
"未命中或传输失败会触发回退，但须满足清理要求，并受下文约束条件限制。"

msgid "## How RFork Matches Seeds"
msgstr "## RFork 如何匹配 seed"

msgid "### How do I enable planner model identity headers?"
msgstr "### 如何启用规划器模型身份请求头？"

msgid ""
"Set `\"rfork_model_identity_headers\": true` in `--model-loader-extra-"
"config`, or set `RFORK_MODEL_IDENTITY_HEADERS=1` in the vLLM worker "
"environment. An explicit JSON `true` or `false` overrides the environment "
"variable; other JSON types, or other environment values, fail configuration "
"initialization. When enabled, RFork adds the `MODEL_URL`, `DEPLOY_STRATEGY`,"
" and `IS_DRAFT` headers to every planner request, and "
"`model_url`/`model_deploy_strategy_name` must contain only ASCII characters."
" The headers are sent in plain text; avoid model URLs containing "
"credentials."
msgstr ""
"在 `--model-loader-extra-config` 中设置 `\"rfork_model_identity_headers\": "
"true`，或在 vLLM worker 环境中设置 `RFORK_MODEL_IDENTITY_HEADERS=1`。显式的 JSON `true` "
"或 `false` 会覆盖环境变量；其他 JSON 类型或其他环境变量值会导致配置初始化失败。启用后，RFork 会在每个规划器请求中附加 "
"`MODEL_URL`、`DEPLOY_STRATEGY` 和 `IS_DRAFT` 请求头，且 "
"`model_url`/`model_deploy_strategy_name` 必须仅包含 ASCII 字符。请求头以明文发送，请避免在模型 URL "
"中包含凭据。"

msgid "### How is the seed HTTP service secured?"
msgstr "### 如何保障 seed HTTP 服务的安全？"

msgid "### Can I use a legacy planner?"
msgstr "### 可以使用旧版规划器吗？"

msgid ""
"Yes. RFork keeps the original seed protocol as the required baseline: `POST "
"/add_seed`, `GET /get_seed`, and `POST /put_seed`. `SEED_KEY` is an opaque "
"value and must be matched as the complete string, and `SEED_RANK` remains "
"required in `/get_seed` responses and in the corresponding seed and lease "
"requests. `SEED_REFCNT` is always sent as `0` and carries no scheduling "
"meaning, but a planner must still accept it."
msgstr ""
"可以。RFork 将原始 seed 协议保留为必需基线：`POST /add_seed`、`GET /get_seed` 和 `POST "
"/put_seed`。`SEED_KEY` 是不透明值，必须按完整字符串匹配；`SEED_RANK` 仍是 `/get_seed` 响应以及对应 "
"seed 和租约请求中的必需字段。`SEED_REFCNT` 始终发送为 `0`，不承载调度语义，但规划器仍必须接受该请求头。"

msgid "### What is transferred for quantized and NZ models?"
msgstr "### 量化和 NZ 模型传输哪些内容？"

msgid ""
"RFork transfers live NPU tensors after Ascend weight post-processing instead"
" of raw checkpoint parameters. The receiver builds the same post-load tensor"
" layout as the seed, and RFork copies the live NPU tensors used by "
"inference. This handles weight transposition, NZ conversion, packed weights,"
" derived scale tensors, and MLA/SFA runtime tensors such as `W_UV` and "
"`W_UK_T`. Empty tensors released during post-processing are not included in "
"the manifest."
msgstr ""
"RFork 传输 Ascend 权重后处理后的活跃 NPU 张量，而不是原始检查点参数。接收端构建与 seed 相同的加载后张量布局，RFork "
"复制推理使用的活跃 NPU 张量。这涵盖权重转置、NZ 转换、打包权重、派生 scale 张量以及 MLA/SFA 运行时张量（如 `W_UV` 和 "
"`W_UK_T`）。后处理期间释放的空张量不会包含在传输清单中。"

msgid ""
"The processed-layout path also applies to non-quantized models when the "
"Ascend configuration sets `weight_nz_mode=2` or the hardware weight-layout "
"policy is `FORCE_NZ`; other non-quantized configurations use checkpoint-"
"layout transfer. To validate, use the same vLLM Ascend code, compatible vLLM"
" versions, the same model revision and quantization configuration, and "
"matching shard and layout settings on both sides, then confirm "
"`source=transfer` and compare output accuracy on NPU hardware. Tensor layout"
" summaries help diagnose structural differences but do not prove tensor "
"value equality."
msgstr ""
"当昇腾配置设置了 `weight_nz_mode=2`，或硬件权重布局策略为 `FORCE_NZ` "
"时，处理后布局路径也适用于非量化模型；其他非量化配置使用检查点布局传输。验证时，seed 和接收端应使用相同的 vLLM Ascend 代码、兼容的 "
"vLLM 版本、相同的模型修订版本和量化配置，以及匹配的分片和布局设置，然后确认 `source=transfer` 并在 NPU "
"硬件上对比输出精度。张量布局摘要有助于诊断结构差异，但不能证明张量取值相等。"

msgid "### How do I tell a seed miss from a transfer failure?"
msgstr "### 如何区分 seed 未命中与传输失败？"

msgid "### Why do tensor IDs differ between seed and receiver?"
msgstr "### 为什么 seed 与接收端的张量 ID 不同？"

msgid "### Does RFork copy padding outside a tensor's payload?"
msgstr "### RFork 会复制张量载荷之外的填充吗？"

msgid ""
"No. RFork intentionally reads exactly `numel * element_size` bytes for each "
"tensor entry, including processed NZ, packed-weight, and derived-scale "
"tensors. Allocation capacity, descriptor-only padding outside the tensor's "
"dense logical range, and adjacent or shared storage are not part of that "
"tensor's payload and are not copied implicitly. A future NPU format that "
"requires bytes outside this range needs explicit manifest and transfer-"
"protocol support. For dense transposes and reshapes, RFork transfers the one"
" continuous byte range covered by a non-overlapping dense tensor and does "
"not require a separate stride-equality check; gapped or overlapping layouts "
"are rejected."
msgstr ""
"不会。RFork 有意为每个张量条目精确读取 `numel * element_size` 字节，包括处理后的 NZ、打包权重和派生 scale "
"张量。分配容量、张量稠密逻辑范围之外的仅描述符填充，以及相邻或共享存储，都不属于该张量的载荷，不会被隐式复制。未来若出现需要该范围之外字节的 NPU "
"格式，需要显式的 manifest 和传输协议支持。对于稠密转置与 reshape，RFork 传输非重叠稠密张量覆盖的一个连续字节范围，不要求单独的 "
"stride 相等性检查；带间隙或重叠的布局仍会被拒绝。"

msgid "### What happens when draft checkpoint metadata cannot be read?"
msgstr "### 无法读取 draft 检查点元数据时会怎样？"

msgid "### How do I configure TransferEngine ports?"
msgstr "### 如何配置 TransferEngine 端口？"

msgid ""
"To enable RFork, pass `--load-format rfork` and provide the required "
"settings through a JSON object in `--model-loader-extra-config` or through "
"the environment variables listed in the fallback table below."
msgstr ""
"要启用 RFork，请传递 `--load-format rfork`，并通过 `--model-loader-extra-config` 中的 "
"JSON 对象或下方回退表中列出的环境变量提供必需设置。"

msgid ""
"| **model_url** | String | Logical model identifier used to build the RFork "
"seed key. | Required for RFork transfer. Instances that should share seeds "
"must use the same value. A non-empty JSON string takes priority over "
"`MODEL_URL`; an absent, empty, or non-string JSON value falls back to the "
"environment variable. |"
msgstr ""
"| **model_url** | 字符串 | 用于构建 RFork seed 键的逻辑模型标识符。 | RFork "
"传输必需。需要共享种子的实例必须使用相同的值。非空 JSON 字符串优先于 `MODEL_URL`；JSON "
"值缺失、为空或非字符串时，回退到该环境变量。 |"

msgid ""
"| **model_deploy_strategy_name** | String | Deployment strategy identifier "
"used together with `model_url` to build the seed key. | Required for RFork "
"transfer. Instances that should share seeds must use the same value. A non-"
"empty JSON string takes priority over `MODEL_DEPLOY_STRATEGY_NAME`; an "
"absent, empty, or non-string JSON value falls back to the environment "
"variable. |"
msgstr ""
"| **model_deploy_strategy_name** | 字符串 | 与 `model_url` 一起用于构建 seed "
"键的部署策略标识符。 | RFork 传输必需。需要共享种子的实例必须使用相同的值。非空 JSON 字符串优先于 "
"`MODEL_DEPLOY_STRATEGY_NAME`；JSON 值缺失、为空或非字符串时，回退到该环境变量。 |"

msgid ""
"| **rfork_scheduler_url** | String | Base URL of the planner service used "
"for seed allocation, release, and heartbeat. | Required for planner-based "
"matching. Example: `http://127.0.0.1:1223`. A non-empty JSON string takes "
"priority over `RFORK_SCHEDULER_URL`; an absent, empty, or non-string JSON "
"value falls back to the environment variable. |"
msgstr ""
"| **rfork_scheduler_url** | 字符串 | 用于种子分配、释放和心跳的规划器服务的基础 URL。 | "
"基于规划器的匹配必需。示例：`http://127.0.0.1:1223`。非空 JSON 字符串优先于 "
"`RFORK_SCHEDULER_URL`；JSON 值缺失、为空或非字符串时，回退到该环境变量。 |"

msgid ""
"| **rfork_seed_timeout_sec** | Number | Timeout for waiting until the local "
"seed HTTP service becomes healthy after startup; together with "
"`rfork_request_timeout_sec`, it also bounds the shutdown wait for the "
"heartbeat thread. | Optional. Default: `5.0`. Must be finite and greater "
"than `0`; a numeric string such as `\"7.5\"` is also accepted. A valid JSON "
"value takes priority over `RFORK_SEED_TIMEOUT_SEC`; an invalid or absent "
"JSON value uses a valid environment value, otherwise the default. |"
msgstr ""
"| **rfork_seed_timeout_sec** | 数字 | 等待本地种子 HTTP 服务在启动后变为健康状态的超时时间；与 "
"`rfork_request_timeout_sec` 一起，还决定关闭时等待心跳线程停止的时间上限。 | 可选。默认值：`5.0`。必须是有限且大于 "
"`0` 的数值；也接受 `\"7.5\"` 这样的数字字符串。有效的 JSON 值优先于 `RFORK_SEED_TIMEOUT_SEC`；JSON "
"值无效或未提供时，使用有效的环境变量值，否则使用默认值。 |"

msgid ""
"| **rfork_seed_bind_host** | String | Local address used by the seed HTTP "
"service. | Optional. Default: `0.0.0.0`. A non-empty JSON string takes "
"priority over `RFORK_SEED_BIND_HOST`; an absent, empty, or non-string JSON "
"value falls back to the environment variable, then to the default. |"
msgstr ""
"| **rfork_seed_bind_host** | 字符串 | 种子 HTTP 服务使用的本地地址。 | 可选。默认值：`0.0.0.0`。非空 "
"JSON 字符串优先于 `RFORK_SEED_BIND_HOST`；JSON 值缺失、为空或非字符串时，回退到该环境变量，再回退到默认值。 |"

msgid "### Environment Variable Fallback"
msgstr "### 环境变量回退"

msgid ""
"The following fields fall back to an environment variable when the JSON "
"config does not provide a usable value:"
msgstr "当 JSON 配置未提供可用值时，以下字段会回退到对应的环境变量："

msgid "| JSON Field | Environment Variable |"
msgstr "| JSON 字段 | 环境变量 |"

msgid "| **model_url** | `MODEL_URL` |"
msgstr "| **model_url** | `MODEL_URL` |"

msgid "| **model_deploy_strategy_name** | `MODEL_DEPLOY_STRATEGY_NAME` |"
msgstr "| **model_deploy_strategy_name** | `MODEL_DEPLOY_STRATEGY_NAME` |"

msgid "| **rfork_scheduler_url** | `RFORK_SCHEDULER_URL` |"
msgstr "| **rfork_scheduler_url** | `RFORK_SCHEDULER_URL` |"

msgid "| **rfork_seed_timeout_sec** | `RFORK_SEED_TIMEOUT_SEC` |"
msgstr "| **rfork_seed_timeout_sec** | `RFORK_SEED_TIMEOUT_SEC` |"

msgid "| **rfork_request_timeout_sec** | `RFORK_REQUEST_TIMEOUT_SEC` |"
msgstr "| **rfork_request_timeout_sec** | `RFORK_REQUEST_TIMEOUT_SEC` |"

msgid "| **rfork_model_identity_headers** | `RFORK_MODEL_IDENTITY_HEADERS` |"
msgstr "| **rfork_model_identity_headers** | `RFORK_MODEL_IDENTITY_HEADERS` |"

msgid "| **rfork_seed_bind_host** | `RFORK_SEED_BIND_HOST` |"
msgstr "| **rfork_seed_bind_host** | `RFORK_SEED_BIND_HOST` |"

msgid "| **rfork_seed_advertise_host** | `RFORK_SEED_ADVERTISE_HOST` |"
msgstr "| **rfork_seed_advertise_host** | `RFORK_SEED_ADVERTISE_HOST` |"

msgid "Resolution rules:"
msgstr "解析规则："

msgid ""
"Both sources are supported configuration inputs. The environment route suits"
" deployments where a platform injects the settings into every worker "
"environment so the vLLM command line stays identical across instances; these"
" variable names are fixed for RFork compatibility and are not migrated to "
"the `VLLM_ASCEND_*` namespace. Guidelines:"
msgstr ""
"两种来源都是受支持的配置输入。环境变量方式适用于由平台向每个 worker 环境注入设置、使 vLLM 命令行在实例间保持一致的场景；这些变量名固定于 "
"RFork 兼容性，不会迁移到 `VLLM_ASCEND_*` 命名空间。使用准则："

msgid ""
"- Environment variables are read once when the RFork loader is constructed; changing them after startup has no effect.\n"
"- Resolve each field from exactly one source per deployment. Precedence is decided per field, so a valid JSON value silently overrides the environment while an unusable one silently loses to it, which makes a mixed setup hard to audit.\n"
"- Keep `model_url` and `model_deploy_strategy_name` identical across all instances that should share seeds. A mismatch between instances shows up as a seed miss and a fallback to storage loading, not as an error."
msgstr ""
"- 环境变量在构造 RFork 加载器时读取一次；启动后再修改不会生效。\n"
"- 每个部署中，每个字段应只从一种来源取值。优先级按字段逐一判定：有效的 JSON 值会静默覆盖环境变量，不可用的 JSON 值又会静默让位于环境变量，因此混用两种来源难以审计。\n"
"- `model_url` 和 `model_deploy_strategy_name` 在所有需要共享种子的实例上必须保持一致。实例间不一致表现为 seed 未命中并回退到存储加载，而不是报错。"

msgid ""
"Verify the installation can import the types RFork uses to initialize the "
"TransferEngine:"
msgstr "验证安装能否导入 RFork 初始化 TransferEngine 所需的类型："

msgid ""
"The same settings can be provided through environment variables instead of "
"`--model-loader-extra-config`; a JSON value for a field still takes priority"
" over its variable:"
msgstr "也可以通过环境变量代替 `--model-loader-extra-config` 提供相同设置；字段的 JSON 值仍优先于其环境变量："

msgid ""
"Because the structural digest exists only after the model is built and its "
"memory is registered, the seed key is computed lazily and logged together "
"with the digest right after registration (INFO on TP rank 0, DEBUG "
"elsewhere). A seed miss therefore leaves a debuggable trail of the exact key"
" and digest that did not match. The key doubles as the seed service "
"credential, so worker logs — like every other path that sees the key — must "
"stay inside the trust boundary described in the [FAQ](#faq)."
msgstr ""
"由于结构摘要仅在模型构建完成且其内存注册之后才存在，seed 键采用惰性计算，并在注册完成后立即与摘要一同记录日志（TP rank 0 上为 "
"INFO，其他为 DEBUG）。因此，种子未命中会留下可调试的痕迹，记录下未能匹配的确切键和摘要。seed 键同时充当 seed 服务的凭据，因此 "
"worker 日志与所有其他能接触到该 key 的路径一样，必须保持在 [FAQ](#faq) 所述的信任边界之内。"

msgid "### Protocol Endpoints"
msgstr "### 协议端点"

msgid ""
"The planner control plane and the per-worker seed HTTP service implement the"
" endpoints below. `SEED_KEY` carries the opaque seed key, `SEED_REFCNT` is "
"always sent as `0` and carries no scheduling meaning, and `SEED_RANK` is "
"required on the wire but must not be used for compatibility decisions (see "
"Constraints and Limitations). When `rfork_model_identity_headers` is "
"enabled, `MODEL_URL`, `DEPLOY_STRATEGY`, and `IS_DRAFT` are attached to "
"every planner request."
msgstr ""
"规划器控制面和每个 worker 的 seed HTTP 服务实现以下端点。`SEED_KEY` 携带不透明的 seed 键，`SEED_REFCNT`"
" 始终发送为 `0`、不承载调度语义，`SEED_RANK` 在协议线上是必需字段但不得用于兼容性决策（参见“约束与限制”）。启用 "
"`rfork_model_identity_headers` 时，`MODEL_URL`、`DEPLOY_STRATEGY` 和 `IS_DRAFT` "
"会附加到每个规划器请求。"

msgid "Planner endpoints:"
msgstr "规划器端点："

msgid "| Endpoint | Method | Purpose | Required request headers | Response |"
msgstr "| 端点 | 方法 | 用途 | 必需的请求头 | 响应 |"

msgid ""
"| `/add_seed` | POST | Heartbeat and seed advertisement. | `SEED_KEY`, "
"`SEED_IP`, `SEED_PORT`, `SEED_RANK`, `SEED_REFCNT` | `200`; `400` on missing"
" or invalid headers |"
msgstr ""
"| `/add_seed` | POST | 心跳与 seed 发布。 | "
"`SEED_KEY`、`SEED_IP`、`SEED_PORT`、`SEED_RANK`、`SEED_REFCNT` | "
"`200`；请求头缺失或非法时返回 `400` |"

msgid ""
"| `/get_seed` | GET | Request a lease on a compatible seed. | `SEED_KEY` | "
"`200` with `SEED_IP`, `SEED_PORT`, `SEED_RANK`, `USER_ID`, and optional "
"`LEASE_TTL_SEC` response headers; `404` when no compatible seed is available"
" |"
msgstr ""
"| `/get_seed` | GET | 请求兼容 seed 的租约。 | `SEED_KEY` | `200`，响应头包含 "
