msgid ""
"RFork targets mainstream model families such as DeepSeek, Qwen, and GLM, but"
" compatibility is determined by the transfer contract rather than the model "
"family name. A model is eligible when its built NPU tensor inventory passes "
"the structural-digest, tensor-ID, manifest, dtype, NPU-format, alias-graph, "
"and non-NPU-state checks. DeepSeek V4.1 Engram CPU offload and checkpoint "
"preparation for `AscendDeepSeekMTP` and DeepSeek V4/V4.1 DSpark drafts have "
"model-specific handling. For other models, quantization variants, or NPU "
"formats, qualify RFork on the target model and hardware by confirming "
"`source=transfer` and comparing output accuracy with the default loader."
msgstr ""
"RFork 面向 DeepSeek、Qwen、GLM 等主流模型系列，但兼容性由传输契约决定，而不是模型系列名称。当模型构建出的 NPU "
"张量清单通过结构摘要、张量 ID、manifest、dtype、NPU 格式、别名关系图和非 NPU 状态检查时，该模型才符合条件。DeepSeek "
"V4.1 Engram CPU 卸载，以及 `AscendDeepSeekMTP` 和 DeepSeek V4/V4.1 DSpark draft "
"的检查点准备有模型专用适配。对于其他模型、量化变体或 NPU 格式，请在目标模型和硬件上确认 `source=transfer` "
"并与默认加载器对比输出精度，以完成 RFork 验证。"

msgid "## Speculative Decoding { #speculative-decoding }"
msgstr "## 投机解码 { #speculative-decoding }"

msgid ""
"With speculative decoding, each worker loads the target model first and then"
" the draft model, and both go through the RFork loader. RFork handles the "
"draft as a separate model:"
msgstr ""
"启用投机解码时，每个 worker 先加载目标模型，再加载 draft 模型，两者都经过 RFork 加载器。RFork 将 draft "
"作为独立模型处理："

msgid ""
"- **Draft detection.** A model is a draft when its model config has `runner_type=\"draft\"`, or its Hugging Face config has a `model_type` ending in `_mtp` or an architecture ending in `MTPModel`.\n"
"- **Separate seed.** The draft has its own RFork session and seed key. The seed key includes the `draft` marker, so a draft never matches a target seed. With a nonzero `rfork_seed_port_base`, the draft seed service uses `base + 2 * global_rank + 1`. When planner model identity headers are enabled, draft requests carry `IS_DRAFT: true`.\n"
"- **Weights shared with the target.** Before registering the draft, RFork takes a snapshot of the weight blocks the target registered. If every transferable draft tensor lies inside those blocks, the draft reports `source=shared_target` and is neither transferred nor published (see [When does a draft model report `shared_target`?](#when-does-a-draft-model-report-shared_target)). Otherwise RFork registers and transfers only the draft tensors outside those blocks.\n"
"- **Checkpoint-dependent draft state.** Many drafts decide in `load_weights`, from the checkpoint weight names, whether they own their embedding and LM head; the proposer then replaces the parts a draft does not own with the target's modules. RFork does not run `load_weights`, so it restores this state before registration for `AscendDeepSeekMTP` and DeepSeek V4/V4.1 DSpark drafts (see the draft checkpoint metadata entry in the [FAQ](#faq)). Other drafts, such as EAGLE/EAGLE3, DFlash, `Glm5NextMTP`, and Qwen3, GLM, or Kimi K3 DSpark, keep their constructor defaults under RFork, which can make the proposer use the wrong embedding or LM head.\n"
"- **Weights rewritten after loading.** With a QuaRot-quantized target, Qwen3, GLM, and Kimi K3 DSpark drafts and DFlash2 drafts rotate a draft projection in place in `post_process`, after the loader has returned and the draft seed may already be published. A receiver can then copy weights that the seed has already rotated, and its own `post_process` rotates them again. RFork does not bypass these configurations.\n"
"- **Qualifying a draft.** Wrong draft state usually lowers the draft acceptance rate rather than changing the output, because the target model still verifies every drafted token. When qualifying a draft with RFork, compare the acceptance rate with the default loader in addition to checking `source=transfer` and output accuracy."
msgstr ""
"- **Draft 识别。** 模型配置的 `runner_type=\"draft\"`，或 Hugging Face 配置的 `model_type` 以 `_mtp` 结尾、architecture 以 `MTPModel` 结尾时，该模型被视为 draft。\n"
"- **独立的 seed。** draft 有自己的 RFork session 和 seed 键。seed 键包含 `draft` 标记，因此 draft 不会匹配到目标模型的 seed。`rfork_seed_port_base` 非零时，draft 的 seed 服务使用 `base + 2 * global_rank + 1`。启用 planner 模型身份请求头时，draft 的请求会携带 `IS_DRAFT: true`。\n"
"- **与目标模型共享的权重。** 注册 draft 前，RFork 会对目标模型已注册的权重块做快照。如果 draft 的每个可传输张量都位于这些块内，draft 报告 `source=shared_target`，既不传输也不发布（参见[draft 模型何时报告 `shared_target`？](#when-does-a-draft-model-report-shared_target)）。否则 RFork 只注册并传输这些块之外的 draft 张量。\n"
"- **依赖检查点的 draft 状态。** 很多 draft 会在 `load_weights` 中根据检查点权重名称，决定是否拥有自己的 embedding 和 LM head；之后 proposer 会把 draft 不拥有的部分替换为目标模型的模块。RFork 不执行 `load_weights`，因此会在注册前为 `AscendDeepSeekMTP` 和 DeepSeek V4/V4.1 DSpark draft 恢复这部分状态（参见 [FAQ](#faq) 中关于 draft 检查点元数据的条目）。其他 draft（例如 EAGLE/EAGLE3、DFlash、`Glm5NextMTP`，以及 Qwen3、GLM 或 Kimi K3 DSpark）在 RFork 下保持构造时的默认值，可能导致 proposer 使用错误的 embedding 或 LM head。\n"
"- **加载后被改写的权重。** 目标模型采用 QuaRot 量化时，Qwen3、GLM、Kimi K3 DSpark draft 以及 DFlash2 draft 会在 `post_process` 中原地旋转一个 draft 投影权重；此时加载器已经返回，draft 的 seed 可能已经发布。接收端可能复制到 seed 已经旋转过的权重，随后自身的 `post_process` 会再旋转一次。RFork 不会自动绕过这些配置。\n"
"- **验证 draft。** draft 状态错误通常会降低 draft 接受率，而不是改变输出，因为目标模型仍会验证每个 draft token。使用 RFork 验证 draft 时，除了检查 `source=transfer` 和输出精度，还要与默认加载器对比接受率。"

msgid ""
"A seed miss or transfer failure can trigger the coordinated default-loader fallback\n"
"described above and cause the Engram tables to be read again.\n"
"The discarded host tables are explicitly released before constructing the fallback\n"
"model; cleanup failure stops loading instead of allocating a second copy.\n"
"RFork accelerates the NPU portion; it does not remove host-table disk I/O. Keep the\n"
"local checkpoint and seed on the same model revision, and use a distinct model\n"
"identity for different checkpoints."
msgstr ""
"seed 未命中或传输失败可能触发上述协调后的默认加载器回退，并再次读取 Engram 表。在构造回退模型前会\n"
"显式释放已丢弃的主机表；清理失败会停止加载，而不是分配第二份副本。RFork 只加速 NPU 部分，不会消除\n"
"主机表的磁盘 I/O。请让本地检查点和 seed 使用相同的模型修订版本，并为不同检查点使用不同的模型标识。"

msgid ""
"RFork itself does not handle the key as a secret, so that segment must "
"include everything that sees it:"
msgstr "RFork 自身并未把该 key 当作密钥保管，因此该网络段必须覆盖所有能接触到它的环节："

msgid ""
"Wrong-key metadata requests return `404`, but the valid/invalid distinction "
"itself remains observable. If a key reaches anything outside the boundary "
"above, rotate `model_deploy_strategy_name`."
msgstr ""
"错误 key 的元数据请求返回 `404`，但有效/无效本身仍是可观测的。若 key 到达上述边界之外的任何环节，请更换 "
"`model_deploy_strategy_name`。"

msgid ""
"1. vLLM starts with `--load-format rfork`.\n"
"2. RFork initializes the model structure on the local NPU, prepares the required tensor layout, and registers local weight memory.\n"
"3. RFork builds a **seed key** from the configuration fingerprint, structural digest, and deployment topology, then asks the planner for a compatible seed.\n"
"4. If a seed is returned, RFork fetches its transfer metadata and copies weights into the registered local buffers through `YuanRong TransferEngine`.\n"
"5. If no compatible seed is returned, or RFork setup, seed acquisition, or transfer fails with one of the error classes RFork handles (import, I/O, runtime, and value errors) in a stage that can be retried, RFork releases its registered memory and seed service, then falls back to the default loader. Fallback is conditional on that cleanup succeeding: if registered memory or the seed service cannot be released, RFork raises instead of allocating a second model while the old weights are still pinned.\n"
"6. A successfully loaded model can publish a local seed service and send heartbeats to the planner. Publication waits for any source lease to be released."
msgstr ""
"1. 使用 `--load-format rfork` 启动 vLLM。\n"
"2. RFork 在本地 NPU 上初始化模型结构，准备所需的张量布局，并注册本地权重内存。\n"
"3. RFork 根据配置指纹、结构摘要和部署拓扑构造 **seed key**，然后向规划器请求兼容的 seed。\n"
"4. 如果返回了 seed，RFork 会获取其传输元数据，并通过 `YuanRong TransferEngine` 将权重复制到已注册的本地缓冲区。\n"
"5. 如果没有返回兼容的 seed，或 RFork 初始化、seed 获取或传输在可重试阶段以 RFork 处理的错误类别（导入、I/O、运行时和取值错误）失败，RFork 会释放已注册内存和 seed 服务，再回退到默认加载器。只有清理成功后才能回退；如果无法释放已注册内存或 seed 服务，RFork 会抛出异常，避免在旧权重仍被固定时分配第二份模型。\n"
"6. 成功加载的模型可以发布本地 seed 服务，并向规划器发送心跳。发布会等待源 seed 的租约释放。"

msgid ""
"| `/health_check_with_key` | GET | Keyed liveness probe. | `seed_key` query "
"parameter | `200` for the valid key; `400` for a wrong key |"
msgstr ""
"| `/health_check_with_key` | GET | 带 key 的存活探测。 | `seed_key` 查询参数 | 正确 key "
"返回 `200`；错误 key 返回 `400` |"

msgid ""
"A draft model whose transferable weights are already owned by the loaded "
"target model skips registration, seed acquisition, and transfer, and reports"
" `source=shared_target`; see [MTP draft weight reuse](#when-does-a-draft-"
"model-report-shared_target)."
msgstr ""
"如果 draft 模型的可传输权重已由已加载的 target 模型持有，RFork 会跳过注册、seed 获取和传输，并报告 "
"`source=shared_target`；参见 [MTP draft 权重复用](#when-does-a-draft-model-report-"
"shared_target)。"

msgid ""
"Engram host-table handling and deployment-wide coordination are covered in "
"the [FAQ](#faq)."
msgstr "Engram 主机表处理和部署级协调请参阅 [FAQ](#faq)。"

msgid "## Architecture"
msgstr "## 架构"

msgid "## Loading Flow"
msgstr "## 加载流程"

msgid ""
"RFork validates this configuration at startup. Invalid values for JSON-only fields, and required values\n"
"missing from both the JSON object and the environment, abort startup instead of falling back to the\n"
"default loader — unless RFork is bypassed first by one of the configurations listed under\n"
"[Constraints and Limitations](#constraints-and-limitations), in which case the default loader runs\n"
"without validating RFork settings. For the fields with an environment-variable fallback, an unusable JSON value is skipped\n"
"in favor of the environment variable or the documented default, as described below. Whether a runtime\n"
"failure falls back depends on the exception class and, with Engram enabled, on the loading stage:\n"
"the handled classes — import, I/O, runtime, and value errors — fall back in retryable loading stages,\n"
"exceptions outside those classes abort startup, and coordinated stages that cannot be safely retried\n"
"(model construction, shared-weight finalization, fallback cleanup, and local loading) abort on any\n"
"failure. Unknown `model_loader_extra_config` keys are ignored with a warning, so check the\n"
"spelling of every field."
msgstr ""
"RFork 会在启动时校验这些配置。仅支持 JSON 的字段取值非法，或必填值在 JSON 对象和环境变量中\n"
"均未提供时，会中止启动而不会回退到默认加载器——除非 RFork 先被[约束与限制](#constraints-and-limitations)中列出的某项配置完全旁路；此时默认加载器会在不校验 RFork 配置的情况下运行。对于支持环境变量回退的字段，不可用的 JSON 值\n"
"会被跳过，改用环境变量或文档中的默认值（见下文）。运行期失败是否回退取决于异常类别，启用\n"
"Engram 时还取决于所在阶段：RFork 处理的类别——导入、I/O、运行时和取值错误——在可重试\n"
"的加载阶段会回退；这些类别之外的异常会中止启动；协调且不能安全重试的阶段（模型构建、共享权重\n"
"finalize、回退清理和本地加载）发生任何失败都会中止。未知的 `model_loader_extra_config` 键会被\n"
"忽略并给出告警，请检查每个字段的拼写。"

msgid ""
"The example planner gives every seed **one capacity point** by default. A "
"seed that already has an active lease is treated as unavailable, and "
"`/get_seed` returns `404` both when no compatible seed exists and when all "
"seeds are out of capacity, so the receiver reports `source=local`. For "
"concurrent scale-out, raise the capacity with `--default-resource-points "
"<N>` (or `RFORK_MOCK_DEFAULT_RESOURCE_POINTS`). See "
"[Troubleshooting](#troubleshooting) for how capacity exhaustion appears in "
"the load summary."
msgstr ""
"示例规划器默认给每个 seed **一个容量点**。已有活动租约的 seed 会被视为不可用，且 `/get_seed` 在没有兼容 seed 和所有 "
"seed 容量耗尽时都会返回 `404`，因此接收端会报告 `source=local`。并发横向扩容时，请通过 `--default-"
"resource-points <N>`（或 "
"`RFORK_MOCK_DEFAULT_RESOURCE_POINTS`）提高容量。容量耗尽在加载摘要中的表现见[故障排查](#troubleshooting)。"

msgid "### How does Engram work with RFork?"
msgstr "### Engram 在 RFork 中如何工作？"

msgid ""
"With Engram CPU offload enabled, RFork transfers NPU weights while offloaded DeepSeek V4.1 Engram tables are loaded\n"
"from the local checkpoint. Every receiver therefore needs the matching indexed\n"
"safetensors checkpoint, including the Engram weights and scales, even when a seed\n"
"is available. RFork reuses the Engram shard reader and supports `dp_shared_memory=true`\n"
"through its existing shared-writer synchronization. Host tables and process-local\n"
"UVA pointers are not transferred."
msgstr ""
"启用 Engram CPU 卸载时，RFork 在从本地检查点加载已卸载的 DeepSeek V4.1 Engram 表时传输 NPU "
"权重。因此，每个接收端都需要匹配的已建立索引的 safetensors 检查点，即使已有 seed，也必须包含 Engram 权重和 "
"scale。RFork 复用 Engram 分片读取器，并通过现有的共享写入同步机制支持 "
"`dp_shared_memory=true`。主机表和进程本地 UVA 指针不会被传输。"

msgid ""
"The host-table rules below apply only with Engram CPU offload. The host table must finish loading before destination registration or shared-weight\n"
"reuse. RFork records completion for the supported DeepSeek table implementation\n"
"and checks tensor identity, storage address, and checkpoint binding before exempting\n"
"its host tensors from the non-NPU state check. Other registered parameters and\n"
"buffers that remain on CPU are still rejected. After the default loader successfully returns, RFork records the same\n"
"state so the locally loaded instance can publish its NPU weights as a seed.\n"
"The model implementation and its default loading path require no RFork hooks."
msgstr ""
"以下主机表规则仅适用于 Engram CPU 卸载。目标端注册或复用共享权重之前，主机表必须完成加载。对于受支持的 DeepSeek 表实现，RFork 会记录完成\n"
"状态，并在将其主机张量从非 NPU 状态检查中豁免前，校验张量身份、存储地址和检查点绑定关系。仍保留在\n"
"CPU 上的其他已注册参数和缓冲区仍会被拒绝。默认加载器成功返回后，RFork 会记录相同状态，使本地加载\n"
"的实例能够将其 NPU 权重发布为 seed。模型实现及其默认加载路径无需添加 RFork 钩子。"

msgid ""
"When a draft model is loaded after its target model, RFork checks whether every transferable draft tensor already falls\n"
"inside a weight block registered by the target. If all draft weights are shared, no draft weight is independent, and no\n"
"non-NPU state remains, RFork skips destination registration, seed acquisition, and the TransferEngine copy. It also\n"
"skips post-load processing, because reprocessing can mutate target-owned storage, then finalizes the model and logs\n"
"`source=shared_target`. This path never contacts the planner and does not publish the draft as a separate seed."
msgstr ""
"当 draft 模型在其 target 模型之后加载时，RFork 会检查每个可传输的 draft 张量是否都已落在 target "
"注册的权重块内。如果所有 draft 权重都共享、没有独立的 draft 权重，且不存在非 NPU 状态，RFork 会跳过目标端注册、seed 获取和"
" TransferEngine 复制。它还会跳过加载后处理，因为重新处理可能改写 target 持有的存储；随后完成模型 finalize 并记录 "
"`source=shared_target`。此路径不会联系规划器，也不会将 draft 作为独立 seed 发布。"

msgid ""
"If any draft tensor is independent or any non-NPU state exists, RFork follows the normal `transfer`, `local`, or\n"
"`fallback` path instead. With Engram enabled, every deployment rank must reach the same decision; a split decision\n"
"aborts startup rather than mixing shared and transferred draft weights."
msgstr ""
"如果任一 draft 张量独立，或存在任何非 NPU 状态，RFork 会改为走正常的 `transfer`、`local` 或 `fallback` "
"路径。启用 Engram 时，每个部署 rank 必须得出一致结论；结论分裂会中止启动，而不是混用共享与传输的 draft 权重。"

msgid ""
"| **rfork_request_timeout_sec** | Number | HTTP connect/read timeout for "
"planner and seed metadata requests. | Optional. Default: `10.0`. Must be "
"finite and greater than `0`; a numeric string such as `\"7.5\"` is also "
"accepted. The startup health probe uses a separate bound: the remaining "
"`rfork_seed_timeout_sec`, capped at 10 seconds. A valid JSON value takes "
"priority over `RFORK_REQUEST_TIMEOUT_SEC`; an invalid or absent JSON value "
"uses a valid environment value, otherwise the default. |"
msgstr ""
"| **rfork_request_timeout_sec** | 数字 | 规划器请求和 seed 元数据请求的 HTTP 连接/读取超时时间。 | "
"可选。默认值：`10.0`。必须是有限且大于 `0` 的数值；也接受 `\"7.5\"` 这样的数字字符串。启动健康探测使用单独的上限：剩余的 "
"`rfork_seed_timeout_sec`，且不超过 10 秒。有效的 JSON 值优先于 "
"`RFORK_REQUEST_TIMEOUT_SEC`；JSON 值无效或未提供时，使用有效的环境变量值，否则使用默认值。 |"

msgid ""
"| **rfork_seed_advertise_host** | String | Address advertised to the planner"
" as `SEED_IP` and returned to receivers as the seed metadata address. This "
"field does not configure the TransferEngine data-plane endpoint. | Optional."
" When unset, the advertised address comes from `VLLM_HOST_IP` when set, "
"otherwise from vLLM's default-route detection, which may be unreachable by "
"peers on multi-NIC hosts. TransferEngine independently calls `get_ip()` "
"during initialization, so multi-NIC deployments must pin the data-plane "
"interface with `VLLM_HOST_IP` (or fix the default route) in addition to "
"setting this field for planner reachability. A non-empty JSON string takes "
"priority over `RFORK_SEED_ADVERTISE_HOST`; an absent, empty, or non-string "
"JSON value falls back to the environment variable, then to automatic "
"detection. |"
msgstr ""
"| **rfork_seed_advertise_host** | 字符串 | 向规划器通告为 `SEED_IP`、并作为 seed "
"元数据地址返回给接收端的地址。本字段不配置 TransferEngine 数据面端点。 | 可选。未设置时，通告地址取 "
"`VLLM_HOST_IP`（若已设置），否则使用 vLLM 的默认路由探测结果；在多网卡主机上该地址可能对端不可达。TransferEngine "
"在初始化时会独立调用 `get_ip()`，因此多网卡部署除了设置本字段以保证规划器可达外，还必须通过 "
"`VLLM_HOST_IP`（或修正默认路由）固定数据面接口。非空 JSON 字符串优先于 "
"`RFORK_SEED_ADVERTISE_HOST`；JSON 值缺失、为空或非字符串时，回退到该环境变量，再回退到自动检测。 |"

msgid ""
"- A valid JSON value always wins: a non-empty string for the string fields, a finite positive number (or numeric string) for the timeout fields, and an explicit `true` or `false` for `rfork_model_identity_headers`.\n"
"- A JSON value that is absent or unusable — an empty string, `null`, the wrong type, or a number that is not finite and positive — is skipped silently: it does not fail configuration initialization, and the environment variable is consulted next. An empty environment variable counts as unset, so the documented default applies (`0.0.0.0` or automatic detection for the optional string fields, the built-in defaults for the timeouts). String values are used exactly as written and are not trimmed. A whitespace-only `model_url` or `model_deploy_strategy_name` counts as set and enters the seed key, producing an unexplained seed miss; whitespace-only values for `rfork_scheduler_url`, `rfork_seed_bind_host`, or `rfork_seed_advertise_host` instead fail when the URL, bind, or advertisement is used.\n"
"- `rfork_model_identity_headers` is the exception: its environment fallback only applies when the JSON key is absent. A JSON value of another type fails configuration initialization, and so does an environment value outside `0`, `1`, `true`, or `false` — including an empty one — because a bad value cannot be told apart from an intentional setting.\n"
"- `model_url`, `model_deploy_strategy_name`, and `rfork_scheduler_url` have no default. When neither the JSON config nor the environment variable provides a non-empty value, startup aborts with a configuration error instead of falling back to the default loader."
msgstr ""
"- 有效的 JSON 值总是优先：字符串字段取非空字符串，超时字段取有限正数（或数字字符串），`rfork_model_identity_headers` 取显式的 `true` 或 `false`。\n"
"- JSON 值缺失或不可用——空字符串、`null`、类型错误，或不是有限正数的数字——时会被静默跳过：不会导致配置初始化失败，而是继续读取环境变量。设置为空的环境变量视为未设置，此时应用文档中的默认值（可选字符串字段为 `0.0.0.0` 或自动检测，超时字段为内置默认值）。字符串值按原样使用、不做裁剪。纯空白的 `model_url` 或 `model_deploy_strategy_name` 会被视为已设置并原样进入 seed 键，最终表现为难以解释的 seed 未命中；`rfork_scheduler_url`、`rfork_seed_bind_host` 或 `rfork_seed_advertise_host` 的纯空白值则会在使用 URL、绑定或发布时失败。\n"
"- `rfork_model_identity_headers` 是例外：仅当 JSON 中未提供该键时才回退到环境变量。JSON 值为其他类型会导致配置初始化失败；环境变量取值不在 `0`、`1`、`true`、`false` 之内（包括空值）同样失败，因为无法区分错误取值与有意设置。\n"
"- `model_url`、`model_deploy_strategy_name` 和 `rfork_scheduler_url` 没有默认值。当 JSON 配置和环境变量都未提供非空值时，会以配置错误中止启动，而不会回退到默认加载器。"

msgid ""
"The example planner serves an unauthenticated `GET /debug/snapshot` route "
"that lists every registered `seed_key` plus every active lease keyed by "
"`USER_ID`, with its seed identity and allocated capacity. Those lease IDs "
"authorize `/renew_seed_lease` and `/put_seed`, so anything that can reach "
"the route can not only learn keys but also renew or release active "
"allocations. Run it only on a trusted or isolated network segment (see the "
"[FAQ](#faq)). The command above binds it to `127.0.0.1` for local testing; "
"when other hosts must reach the planner, bind a trusted internal interface "
"instead of `0.0.0.0`."
msgstr ""
"示例规划器提供无鉴权的 `GET /debug/snapshot` 路由，会列出所有已注册的 `seed_key`，以及按 `USER_ID` "
"索引的所有活动租约及其 seed 身份和已分配容量。这些租约 ID 可用于调用 `/renew_seed_lease` 和 "
"`/put_seed`，因此任何能访问该路由的对象不仅能获取 key，还能续租或释放活动分配。请仅在可信或隔离的网络段中运行（参见 "
"[FAQ](#faq)）。上面的命令将其绑定到 `127.0.0.1` 以便本地测试；当其他主机需要访问规划器时，请绑定可信的内部网卡，而不是 "
"`0.0.0.0`。"

msgid ""
"- **Startup aborts with an RFork configuration error.** A required field is missing from both the JSON object and its environment variable, or a JSON-only field holds an invalid value. Check the spelling of every field — unknown keys are only warned — and re-read the resolution rules under Environment Variable Fallback.\n"
"- **Startup aborts during RFork setup or transfer.** The failure was not a fallback-eligible error class, or it happened in a stage that cannot be retried. The exception in the log identifies the failed step; fix it and restart the workers.\n"
"- **`source=local` in the load summary.** No usable lease was acquired: no compatible seed was available, all seeds were out of capacity, or the planner request or response failed validation. Compare the logged `seed_key` and `structural_digest` against the seed instance's values, and check the planner's lease and capacity state. The example planner allows one concurrent lease per seed unless `--default-resource-points` is raised. A lease rejected after allocation is retained for release, so the planner may still show a short-lived allocation for this attempt.\n"
"- **`source=fallback` in the load summary.** RFork failed with a handled error in a retryable stage and fell back to the default loader. This does not imply a lease was acquired: registration initializes the TransferEngine before any seed lease. Inspect the `RFork transfer failed` WARNING and the planner warning next to it.\n"
"- **`source=shared_target` in the load summary.** A draft model reused weights already owned by its target model. No planner request or transfer occurred; this is expected when every draft tensor is shared, and it is not a fallback.\n"
"- **Every instance reports `source=local`.** Usually a seed-key mismatch across instances: different model revisions or quantization configs, different `model_url` or `model_deploy_strategy_name` values, or different shard and layout settings. Diff the identity log (`RFork ... seed identity bound`) across instances. If the keys match, check whether the planner has exhausted each seed's capacity.\n"
"- **Fingerprints match but structural digests differ.** The tensor inventories differ. Check weight dtype, NZ or fused MC2 layout switches, TP/PP/EP sharding, and quantization post-processing; use the `RFork tensor layout summary` to locate the differing tensors.\n"
"- **Planner heartbeat or advertisement failures.** Temporary planner outages do not stop inference; retries continue in the background and logging is bounded to the first failure, periodic summaries, and recovery events. Check `rfork_scheduler_url` reachability and `rfork_request_timeout_sec`.\n"
"- **TransferEngine import or initialization errors.** Run the import check above. A missing package is a handled error class: RFork falls back to the default loader instead of transferring.\n"
"- **Seed HTTP port conflicts.** A nonzero `rfork_seed_port_base` with an occupied slot falls back to OS assignment; keep the base range separate from the serving port, the TransferEngine RPC port, and the HIXL endpoint range.\n"
"- **Startup hangs with Engram enabled.** Coordinated stages abort rather than split the group, so a hang usually points to a collective outside those stages or an external dependency such as storage or the planner. Collect per-rank stack traces and check the distributed timeout."
msgstr ""
"- **启动时因 RFork 配置错误而中止。** 必需字段在 JSON 对象和环境变量中均未提供，或仅支持 JSON 的字段取值非法。检查每个字段的拼写——未知键只会告警——并重新阅读“环境变量回退”中的解析规则。\n"
"- **启动在 RFork 初始化或传输阶段中止。** 失败不属于可回退的错误类别，或发生在无法重试的阶段。日志中的异常会指出失败的步骤；修复后重启 worker。\n"
"- **加载摘要显示 `source=local`。** 未获得可用租约：没有兼容的 seed、所有 seed 容量耗尽，或规划器请求/响应未通过校验。将记录的 `seed_key` 与 `structural_digest` 与 seed 实例的值进行对比，并检查规划器的租约与容量状态。除非提高 `--default-resource-points`，示例规划器每个 seed 只允许一个并发租约。分配后被拒绝的租约仍会保留以便释放，因此规划器中可能短暂出现本次尝试的分配记录。\n"
"- **加载摘要显示 `source=fallback`。** RFork 在可重试阶段以可处理的错误失败并回退到默认加载器。这不意味着一定获得过租约：注册先于任何 seed 租约初始化 TransferEngine。检查 `RFork transfer failed` WARNING 及其相邻的规划器警告。\n"
"- **加载摘要显示 `source=shared_target`。** draft 模型复用了 target 模型已持有的权重。没有发生规划器请求或传输；当所有 draft 张量都共享时这是预期行为，不属于回退。\n"
"- **所有实例都报告 `source=local`。** 通常是实例间 seed 键不一致：模型修订版本或量化配置不同、`model_url` 或 `model_deploy_strategy_name` 取值不同，或分片与布局设置不同。对比各实例的身份日志（`RFork ... seed identity bound`）。如果键一致，请检查规划器是否已耗尽每个 seed 的容量。\n"
"- **指纹相同但结构摘要不同。** 张量清单存在差异。检查权重 dtype、NZ 或融合 MC2 布局开关、TP/PP/EP 分片以及量化后处理；使用 `RFork tensor layout summary` 定位差异张量。\n"
"- **规划器心跳或发布失败。** 临时规划器故障不会停止推理；重试在后台继续，日志仅记录首次失败、周期性摘要和恢复事件。检查 `rfork_scheduler_url` 可达性和 `rfork_request_timeout_sec`。\n"
"- **TransferEngine 导入或初始化错误。** 运行上面的导入检查。缺少软件包属于可处理的错误类别：RFork 会回退到默认加载器而不是进行传输。\n"
"- **seed HTTP 端口冲突。** 非零 `rfork_seed_port_base` 对应的槽位被占用时会回退到操作系统分配；请将基准范围与服务端口、TransferEngine RPC 端口和 HIXL 端点范围分开。\n"
"- **启用 Engram 时启动挂起。** 协调阶段会中止而不是分裂该组，因此挂起通常指向这些阶段之外的集合通信或外部依赖（如存储或规划器）。收集每个 rank 的堆栈并检查分布式超时。"

msgid ""
"> **Coordination scope:** Whenever `engram_config` is set — with or without CPU offload — the loader stages wrapped by\n"
"> the deployment-wide coordinator run over the deployment world's CPU group: session setup, model construction,\n"
"> model-state preparation, host weight loading, shared-weight inspection, transfer-layout preparation, weight transfer,\n"
"> transferred-model finalization, fallback cleanup, and local model loading. A fallback-eligible failure in one of those\n"
"> stages — such as a seed miss, registration failure, or transfer failure — on any rank makes every rank load locally,\n"
"> while failures in wrapped stages that cannot be safely retried, such as model construction, shared-weight\n"
"> finalization, fallback cleanup, and local loading, abort every rank instead of splitting the group. Bypass selection\n"
"> and processed-layout detection run before the coordinator is created, so they are not covered by this coordination.\n"
"> This coordination is not yet covered by dedicated distributed tests; validate group fallback behavior on target\n"
"> hardware before relying on it."
msgstr ""
"> **协调范围：** 只要设置了 `engram_config`——无论是否启用 CPU 卸载——由部署级协调器包裹的加载阶段会通过部署 world "
"的 CPU group 运行：会话建立、模型构建、模型状态准备、主机权重加载、共享权重检查、传输布局准备、权重传输、传输后模型 "
"finalize、回退清理和本地模型加载。在这些阶段中，任一 rank 上出现可回退的失败（例如 seed 未命中、注册失败或传输失败）时，所有 "
"rank 都会改为本地加载；而在被包裹且无法安全重试的阶段（如模型构建、共享权重 finalize、回退清理和本地加载）出错时，所有 rank "
"都会中止，而不是把该组分裂。旁路选择和 processed-layout "
"判定在协调器创建之前完成，因此不属于此协调范围。该协调机制目前没有专门的分布式测试覆盖；在生产中依赖它之前，请在目标硬件上验证组内回退行为。"

msgid ""
"- **Worker logs.** The full key is logged when the seed identity is bound (INFO on TP rank 0, DEBUG on other ranks) and again in heartbeat, advertisement, and seed-service failure and recovery messages at INFO, WARNING, or ERROR (including the planner-rejection withdrawal reason). Treat log aggregation and storage as part of the trust boundary.\n"
"- **HTTP intermediaries.** Seed metadata and health-check requests send the key as a URL query parameter, so anything on the plain-HTTP path — proxies, access logs — sees it.\n"
"- **The planner.** Seed advertisements plus `/get_seed` and `/remove_seed` requests carry the key in the `SEED_KEY` header, so the planner and anything inspecting that traffic hold every key it serves; lease renewal and release requests identify the lease by seed address, rank, and user ID instead. The bundled example planner exposes all registered keys and active lease `USER_ID` values without authentication on `GET /debug/snapshot`; because those IDs authorize lease renewal and release, keep the route unreachable from outside the segment."
msgstr ""
"- **worker 日志。** 绑定 seed 身份时会完整记录 key（TP rank 0 为 INFO，其他 rank 为 DEBUG），心跳、发布以及 seed 服务失败与恢复的日志消息中也会再次出现（INFO、WARNING 或 ERROR，包括规划器拒绝时嵌入 key 的撤销原因）。日志收集与存储应视为信任边界的一部分。\n"
"- **HTTP 中间设备。** seed 元数据和健康检查请求将 key 作为 URL 查询参数发送，明文 HTTP 路径上的代理和访问日志都能看到它。\n"
"- **规划器。** seed 广告以及 `/get_seed`、`/remove_seed` 请求通过 `SEED_KEY` 请求头携带 key，规划器及任何能观测这些流量的对象都持有其服务的全部 key；租约续租和释放请求则通过 seed 地址、rank 和 user ID 标识租约。随附的示例规划器在 `GET /debug/snapshot` 上无鉴权地暴露所有已注册 key 和活动租约的 `USER_ID`；由于这些 ID 可用于续租和释放租约，请勿让信任段之外的对象访问该路由。"

msgid ""
"Seed removal and draining are optional control-plane extensions controlled "
"by `rfork_seed_removal_supported`. The outcome depends on the planner "
"response. A confirmed removal (`200`, `409`, or a `404` confirmed as absent)"
" stops heartbeats and the metadata service. When removal is unsupported "
"(`405`/`501`, or the default `false` setting) or unconfirmed (an unexplained"
" `404`), RFork stops heartbeats and attempts to stop the metadata service, "
"but retains the published seed's registered memory until cleanup succeeds or"
" the process exits. Permanent rejections keep the metadata service and "
"registered memory available for a later retry, while timeouts, `408`/`429`, "
"and `5xx` are retried."
msgstr ""
"Seed 删除和 draining 是可选的控制面扩展，由 `rfork_seed_removal_supported` "
"控制。具体结果取决于规划器响应。确认删除（`200`、`409`，或确认记录不存在的 "
"`404`）会停止心跳和元数据服务。当删除不受支持（`405`/`501`，或默认的 `false` 设置）或未确认（含义不明的 "
"`404`）时，RFork 会停止心跳并尝试停止元数据服务，但会保留已发布 seed "
"的已注册内存，直到清理成功或进程退出。永久性拒绝会保留元数据服务和已注册内存，以便之后重试；超时、`408`/`429` 和 `5xx` 则会重试。"

msgid ""
"Seed acquisition that produces no usable lease — whether because no "
"compatible seed is available, all seeds are out of capacity, or because the "
"planner request or response fails validation — logs `seed acquisition was "
"unsuccessful; loading locally` (INFO on the summary rank, DEBUG elsewhere) "
"and reports `source=local`. A failure during RFork setup or transfer, such "
"as registration, metadata, or weight-read errors, logs `RFork transfer "
"failed` at WARNING and reports `source=fallback`. Inspect the planner "
"warning to distinguish the two. A draft model that reuses target-owned "
"weights reports `source=shared_target` instead and does not contact the "
"planner. If the response fails validation after an allocation was created, "
"RFork keeps that allocation for release and still reports `source=local`."
msgstr ""
"未获得可用租约的 seed 获取（可能是没有兼容 seed、所有 seed 容量耗尽，也可能是规划器请求或响应校验失败）会记录 `seed "
"acquisition was unsuccessful; loading locally`（summary rank 为 INFO，其他 rank 为"
" DEBUG），并报告 `source=local`。RFork 初始化或传输期间的失败（例如注册、元数据或权重读取错误）会在 WARNING 级别记录"
" `RFork transfer failed`，并报告 `source=fallback`。可结合规划器警告区分两者。复用 target 所持权重的 "
"draft 模型则会改为报告 `source=shared_target`，不会联系规划器。如果响应在已创建分配之后才校验失败，RFork "
"会保留该分配以便释放，但仍报告 `source=local`。"

msgid ""
"For MTP drafts using `AscendDeepSeekMTP` and DeepSeek V4/V4.1 DSpark drafts, RFork prepares checkpoint-dependent\n"
"state before registering tensors: head ownership and module aliases for `AscendDeepSeekMTP`, and embedding and head\n"
"ownership for DSpark. It reads the names in the selected safetensors headers using the default loader's source,\n"
"revision, and file-selection rules. Uncached remote checkpoints may be downloaded during this preparation. If the\n"
"metadata cannot be read, including checkpoints selected in PT/bin format, RFork uses the default loader and does not\n"
"publish that model as a seed. This adaptation stays within the RFork loader. For `AscendDeepSeekMTP`, it reuses the\n"
"model's head-ownership helper. For DSpark, it reuses the model's checkpoint-name mapping together with the\n"
"embedding/head naming rule from its `load_weights`. It currently covers only these drafts. Other draft\n"
"implementations, such as `Glm5NextMTP` and other DSpark drafts, also derive head ownership from checkpoint weights,\n"
"and RFork does not run their normal `load_weights` before registration; qualify `source=transfer` and output accuracy\n"
"on the target model and hardware before relying on draft weight reuse."
msgstr ""
"对于采用 `AscendDeepSeekMTP` 实现的 MTP draft 和 DeepSeek V4/V4.1 DSpark draft，RFork"
" 会在注册张量前准备依赖检查点的状态：`AscendDeepSeekMTP` 准备 head 所有权和模块别名，DSpark 准备 embedding "
"和 head 所有权。它会按照默认加载器的 source、revision 和文件选择规则，读取所选 safetensors "
"头部中的名称。准备过程中可能下载未缓存的远程检查点。如果无法读取元数据（包括以 PT/bin 格式选择的检查点），RFork "
"会使用默认加载器，并不会将该模型发布为 seed。此适配保留在 RFork 加载器内：对 `AscendDeepSeekMTP`，复用模型的 head "
"所有权辅助函数；对 DSpark，复用模型的检查点名称映射，以及其 `load_weights` 中 embedding/head "
"的命名规则。目前仅覆盖这些 draft。其他 draft 实现（例如 `Glm5NextMTP` 和其他 DSpark draft）同样从检查点权重推导"
" head 所有权，而 RFork 在注册前不会执行它们正常的 `load_weights`；在依赖 draft 权重复用前，请在目标模型和硬件上验证 "
"`source=transfer` 及输出精度。"

msgid ""
"The YuanRong TransferEngine RPC port is not a configuration field: RFork initializes the engine with port `0`, and the\n"
"engine binds and holds an OS-assigned port that RFork reads back via `get_rpc_port()` and publishes as the transfer\n"
"session endpoint. The endpoint host is chosen independently by vLLM's `get_ip()`, which honors `VLLM_HOST_IP`;\n"
"`rfork_seed_advertise_host` changes only the planner advertisement. To constrain the engine to a fixed port range (for example, for firewall rules), set YuanRong's\n"
"`YR_TE_RPC_PORT_MIN` and `YR_TE_RPC_PORT_MAX` environment variables (both required, valid within `1024-65535` and\n"
"outside the ephemeral range `32768-60999`); invalid values fall back to OS assignment. Keep this range separate from\n"
"the seed HTTP ports and the HIXL endpoint range. The HIXL data-plane endpoints default to base port `22000`\n"
"(`YR_TE_HIXL_BASE_PORT`, 100 ports per physical device), which stays clear of Mooncake ADXL's default `20000`-based\n"
"segments on nodes that co-locate both engines."
msgstr ""
"YuanRong TransferEngine 的 RPC 端口不是配置字段：RFork 以端口 `0` "
"初始化该引擎，引擎会绑定并持有一个由操作系统分配的端口，RFork 通过 `get_rpc_port()` "
"读回该端口，并将其发布为传输会话端点。端点主机由 vLLM 的 `get_ip()` 独立选择，该函数会遵循 "
"`VLLM_HOST_IP`；`rfork_seed_advertise_host` "
"只会改变规划器广告。若要将引擎限制在固定的端口范围内（例如用于防火墙规则），请设置 YuanRong 的 `YR_TE_RPC_PORT_MIN` 和 "
"`YR_TE_RPC_PORT_MAX` 环境变量（两者均为必需，有效范围在 `1024-65535` 内且不处于临时端口范围 "
"`32768-60999`）；无效值会回退到由操作系统分配。请将此端口范围与种子 HTTP 端口和 HIXL 端点范围分开。HIXL "
"数据平面端点默认使用基准端口 `22000`（`YR_TE_HIXL_BASE_PORT`，每个物理设备 100 "
"个端口），在同时部署两种引擎的节点上，该范围与 Mooncake ADXL 默认基于 `20000` 的段保持错开。"

msgid "## Constraints and Limitations { #constraints-and-limitations }"
