msgid "## Key Concepts"
msgstr "## 关键概念"

msgid "| Term | Meaning |"
msgstr "| 术语 | 含义 |"

msgid ""
"| **Seed** | A loaded instance that advertises its NPU weight memory and can"
" serve weights to compatible receivers. |"
msgstr "| **Seed** | 已加载并对外发布 NPU 权重内存、可向兼容接收端提供权重的实例。 |"

msgid ""
"| **Planner** | External control-plane service that matches seed keys, "
"allocates leases, tracks heartbeats, and optionally removes seeds. |"
msgstr "| **规划器（Planner）** | 外部控制面服务，负责匹配 seed 键、分配租约、跟踪心跳，并可选地删除 seed。 |"

msgid ""
"| **Seed key** | Opaque identifier derived from the compatibility "
"fingerprint, structural digest, and shard topology. It is also the "
"credential for the seed metadata service. |"
msgstr "| **Seed 键** | 由兼容性指纹、结构摘要和分片拓扑派生的不透明标识符。它同时充当 seed 元数据服务的凭据。 |"

msgid ""
"| **Compatibility fingerprint** | Digest of configuration that changes "
"tensor contents but not shapes, such as the RFork protocol version, model "
"revision, quantization config, architecture, RoPE settings, `kv_role`, and "
"`mix_placement`. |"
msgstr ""
"| **兼容性指纹** | 对改变张量内容但不改变形状的配置计算的摘要，例如 RFork 协议版本、模型修订版本、量化配置、架构、RoPE "
"设置、`kv_role` 和 `mix_placement`。 |"

msgid ""
"| **Structural digest** | Digest of the built model's transferable tensor "
"inventory: stable IDs, shapes, dtypes, and NPU formats. |"
msgstr "| **结构摘要** | 对已构建模型的可传输张量清单计算的摘要：稳定 ID、形状、dtype 和 NPU 格式。 |"

msgid ""
"| **Lease** | Temporary allocation of seed capacity for one receiver, "
"released through `/put_seed` after use. |"
msgstr "| **租约** | 为单个接收端临时分配的 seed 容量，使用后通过 `/put_seed` 释放。 |"

msgid ""
"| **Load source** | Final result reported in the load summary: `transfer`, "
"`local`, `fallback`, or `shared_target`. |"
msgstr ""
"| **加载来源** | 加载摘要中报告的最终结果：`transfer`、`local`、`fallback` 或 `shared_target`。 |"

msgid "### 4. Scale Out Across Ranks"
msgstr "### 4. 多 rank 横向扩容"

msgid ""
"RFork derives the seed key per worker, so every rank must start with the "
"same deployment identity and layout settings. For a single-node TP8 "
"deployment:"
msgstr "RFork 按 worker 派生 seed 键，因此每个 rank 必须使用相同的部署身份和布局设置启动。单节点 TP8 部署示例："

msgid ""
"Each worker has its own `global_rank`. With a nonzero "
"`rfork_seed_port_base`, reserve two ports per worker: main uses `base + 2 * "
"global_rank`, draft uses `base + 2 * global_rank + 1`, so the base range "
"must cover `2 * world_size` slots."
msgstr ""
"每个 worker 都有自己的 `global_rank`。设置非零 `rfork_seed_port_base` 时，每个 worker "
"预留两个端口：主模型使用 `base + 2 * global_rank`，draft 使用 `base + 2 * global_rank + "
"1`，因此基准范围必须覆盖 `2 * world_size` 个槽位。"

msgid ""
"On multi-NIC or multi-node deployments, pin both planes per node: set "
"`rfork_seed_advertise_host` (or `VLLM_HOST_IP`) so peers can reach the seed "
"HTTP service, and set `VLLM_HOST_IP` so TransferEngine uses the intended "
"data-plane interface."
msgstr ""
"在多网卡或多机部署中，需要按节点固定两个平面：设置 `rfork_seed_advertise_host`（或 "
"`VLLM_HOST_IP`），使对端能访问 seed HTTP 服务；同时设置 `VLLM_HOST_IP`，使 TransferEngine "
"使用预期的数据面网卡。"

msgid "#### Sizing and availability"
msgstr "#### 容量与可用性"

msgid "## Upgrade and Rolling Restart"
msgstr "## 升级与滚动重启"

msgid ""
"Seed reuse requires exact agreement on the compatibility fingerprint, "
"structural digest, and shard topology. After any of the following changes, "
"existing seeds no longer match new receivers, and new instances load from "
"storage until a new generation of seeds is published:"
msgstr ""
"seed 复用要求兼容性指纹、结构摘要和分片拓扑完全一致。发生以下任一变更后，已有 seed 将不再匹配新接收端，新实例会从存储加载，直到发布新一代 "
"seed："

msgid ""
"- A vLLM Ascend or vLLM upgrade that changes the RFork protocol version or the built tensor layout.\n"
"- A model revision, checkpoint, or quantization configuration change.\n"
"- An architecture, RoPE, `kv_role`, `mix_placement`, or layout switch such as NZ or fused MC2.\n"
"- A TP/PP/EP/DP topology or fine-grained TP configuration change."
msgstr ""
"- vLLM Ascend 或 vLLM 升级改变了 RFork 协议版本或构建出的张量布局。\n"
"- 模型修订版本、检查点或量化配置发生变化。\n"
"- 架构、RoPE、`kv_role`、`mix_placement` 或布局开关（如 NZ、融合 MC2）发生变化。\n"
"- TP/PP/EP/DP 拓扑或细粒度 TP 配置发生变化。"

msgid ""
"During a rolling restart, expect mixed old and new instances to report "
"`source=local` rather than transfer. Stop or drain old seeds before reusing "
"the same `model_url` and `model_deploy_strategy_name`, let the first "
"upgraded instance load from storage and publish a new seed, then start the "
"remaining receivers. Account for the planner's stale-seed TTL so old "
"advertisements expire before capacity is reused."
msgstr ""
"滚动重启期间，新旧实例混跑时应预期出现 `source=local` 而不是传输。复用相同的 `model_url` 和 "
"`model_deploy_strategy_name` 之前，请先停止或 drain 旧 seed；让第一个升级后的实例从存储加载并发布新 "
"seed，再启动其余接收端。请考虑规划器的过期 seed TTL，确保旧广告在容量被复用前过期。"

msgid ""
"If you intentionally start a new seed pool without upgrading, change "
"`model_deploy_strategy_name` so old and new seeds cannot match."
msgstr ""
"如果要在不升级的情况下开启新的 seed 池，请修改 `model_deploy_strategy_name`，使新旧 seed 无法互相匹配。"

msgid "## Related Documentation"
msgstr "## 相关文档"

msgid ""
"- [Netloader Guide](netloader.md) for peer-to-peer weight loading without a planner.\n"
"- [Sleep Mode](sleep_mode.md) and [Expert Parallelism Load Balancer](expert_parallelism_load_balancer.md) for configurations that bypass RFork.\n"
"- [Environment Variables](../configuration/env_vars.md) for the standard `VLLM_ASCEND_*` variables; RFork-specific variables are documented above.\n"
"- [Supported Features](../support_matrix/supported_features.md) and [Release Notes](../release_notes.md) for support status and changes."
msgstr ""
"- [Netloader 指南](netloader.md)：无需规划器的点对点权重加载。\n"
"- [睡眠模式](sleep_mode.md) 和 [专家并行负载均衡器](expert_parallelism_load_balancer.md)：会旁路 RFork 的配置。\n"
"- [环境变量](../configuration/env_vars.md)：标准 `VLLM_ASCEND_*` 变量；RFork 专用变量见上文。\n"
"- [支持特性](../support_matrix/supported_features.md) 和 [发布说明](../release_notes.md)：支持状态与变更记录。"

msgid ""
"For pipeline, expert, or data parallelism, pass the same `--pipeline-"
"parallel-size` value, the same `--enable-expert-parallel` setting, or the "
"same `--data-parallel-size` value on every instance. The seed key then "
"includes `pp_rank`, `ep_rank`, and, when weights are actually sharded across"
" DP, `sharded_dp_rank`; a mismatch shows up as `source=local`, not as a "
"startup error."
msgstr ""
"使用流水线并行、专家并行或数据并行时，每个实例都必须传入相同的 `--pipeline-parallel-size` 值、相同的 `--enable-"
"expert-parallel` 设置或相同的 `--data-parallel-size` 值。此时 seed 键会包含 "
"`pp_rank`、`ep_rank`，并在权重确实沿 DP 分片时包含 `sharded_dp_rank`；不一致会表现为 "
"`source=local`，而不是启动报错。"

msgid ""
"RFork manages its own environment variables: they are read and validated "
"inside the RFork loader, not registered in `vllm_ascend/envs.py`, so they do"
" not appear on the generated [Environment "
"Variables](../configuration/env_vars.md) page. Treat this section as the "
"source of truth for RFork deployments."
msgstr ""
"RFork 自行管理其环境变量：这些变量在 RFork 加载器内部读取和校验，不会注册到 "
"`vllm_ascend/envs.py`，因此不会出现在生成的[环境变量](../configuration/env_vars.md)页面中。RFork"
" 部署请以本节为准。"

msgid ""
"If the seed service or its planner advertisement fails after the model is "
"loaded, inference continues. RFork logs the failure and keeps the model "
"available, but that instance is not advertised as a seed."
msgstr "如果模型加载完成后 seed 服务或其规划器发布失败，推理仍会继续。RFork 会记录失败并保持模型可用，但该实例不会被发布为 seed。"

msgid ""
"- Start with one concurrent receiver per seed and increase capacity only after measuring seed-side inference latency and NIC throughput. The example planner defaults to one capacity point per seed.\n"
"- Register more than one seed per seed key when receivers scale out; the planner should spread leases across seeds instead of always selecting the first.\n"
"- Keep the heartbeat interval below the planner's stale-seed TTL, and make the lease TTL longer than the expected transfer plus a safety margin. Enable lease renewal when the planner advertises `LEASE_TTL_SEC`.\n"
"- Treat the planner as a control-plane dependency, not a data-plane one: keep seed-to-receiver transfers independent of planner availability, and make initial advertisements, lease releases, and removals retry safely.\n"
"- Expose seed count, per-seed capacity, lease age, and hit/fallback rate so capacity exhaustion is visible before it turns into `source=local`.\n"
"- The example planner keeps seeds and leases in memory. After a planner restart, seeds re-register through heartbeats, but in-flight leases are lost; RFork treats a `/put_seed` `404` as released. Production planners must persist state or make lease release idempotent."
msgstr ""
"- 初始时每个 seed 只允许一个并发接收端；只有在测量 seed 侧推理延迟和网卡吞吐后，才提高容量。示例规划器默认每个 seed 一个容量点。\n"
"- 接收端横向扩容时，为同一 seed 键注册多个 seed；规划器应把租约分散到不同 seed，而不是总是选择第一个。\n"
"- 保持心跳间隔小于规划器的过期 seed TTL，并让租约 TTL 大于预期传输时间加安全余量。规划器通告 `LEASE_TTL_SEC` 时，应启用租约续租。\n"
"- 将规划器视为控制面依赖，而不是数据面依赖：seed 到接收端的传输应独立于规划器可用性，初始发布、租约释放和删除都必须能安全重试。\n"
"- 暴露 seed 数量、每个 seed 的容量、租约年龄以及命中/回退率，使容量耗尽在变成 `source=local` 之前就能被发现。\n"
"- 示例规划器把 seed 和租约保存在内存中。规划器重启后，seed 会通过心跳重新注册，但进行中的租约将丢失；RFork 把 `/put_seed` 的 `404` 视为已释放。生产规划器必须持久化状态，或保证租约释放幂等。"

msgid "#### Network Reachability"
msgstr "#### 网络可达性"

msgid "| Path | Transport / port | Direction | Configured by |"
msgstr "| 路径 | 传输 / 端口 | 方向 | 配置项 |"

msgid ""
"| Planner control plane | HTTP, `rfork_scheduler_url` | worker → planner | "
"`rfork_scheduler_url` |"
msgstr ""
"| 规划器控制面 | HTTP，`rfork_scheduler_url` | worker → planner | "
"`rfork_scheduler_url` |"

msgid ""
"| Seed metadata | HTTP, seed port | receiver → seed | "
"`rfork_seed_bind_host`, `rfork_seed_port_base` or OS assignment, "
"`rfork_seed_advertise_host` |"
msgstr ""
"| seed 元数据 | HTTP，seed 端口 | 接收端 → seed | "
"`rfork_seed_bind_host`、`rfork_seed_port_base` 或 OS "
"分配、`rfork_seed_advertise_host` |"

msgid ""
"| Weight transfer | TransferEngine RPC and HIXL | receiver ↔ seed | "
"`YR_TE_RPC_PORT_MIN`/`YR_TE_RPC_PORT_MAX`, `YR_TE_HIXL_BASE_PORT` |"
msgstr ""
"| 权重传输 | TransferEngine RPC 与 HIXL | 接收端 ↔ seed | "
"`YR_TE_RPC_PORT_MIN`/`YR_TE_RPC_PORT_MAX`、`YR_TE_HIXL_BASE_PORT` |"

msgid "| vLLM serving | HTTP | client → instance | `--port` |"
msgstr "| vLLM 服务 | HTTP | 客户端 → 实例 | `--port` |"

msgid ""
"The planner never connects to seed services; it only returns the advertised "
"`SEED_IP` and `SEED_PORT`. Receivers must be able to open the seed HTTP "
"port, and seed and receiver must be able to reach each other's "
"TransferEngine and HIXL endpoints."
msgstr ""
"规划器不会主动连接 seed 服务，只返回通告的 `SEED_IP` 和 `SEED_PORT`。接收端必须能访问 seed HTTP 端口，且 "
"seed 与接收端必须能互相访问对方的 TransferEngine 和 HIXL 端点。"

msgid ""
"It is not secured by the service itself. The seed HTTP service is a trust "
"boundary: the `seed_key` acts as a credential, and anyone who learns it can "
"fetch the transfer metadata (tensor addresses and the TransferEngine "
"session) and read the instance's NPU weight memory through the "
"TransferEngine. Requests are plain HTTP without authentication or rate "
"limiting, so RFork must be deployed on a trusted or isolated network "
"segment. `rfork_seed_bind_host` defaults to `0.0.0.0`; keep that only when "
"every reachable interface is inside the trust boundary, and bind the "
"internal interface on multi-NIC hosts."
msgstr ""
"该服务本身不做安全保障。seed HTTP 服务是一道信任边界：`seed_key` 即凭据，任何拿到它的人都能获取传输元数据（张量地址与 "
"TransferEngine 会话），并通过 TransferEngine 读取该实例的 NPU 权重内存。请求为明文 "
"HTTP，无鉴权、无速率限制，因此 RFork 必须部署在可信或隔离的网络段。`rfork_seed_bind_host` 默认是 "
"`0.0.0.0`；仅当所有可达网卡都在信任边界内时才保留该默认值，多网卡主机应绑定内部接口。"

msgid ""
"`LEASE_TTL_SEC` is an optional response header. When it is absent, RFork "
"accepts the lease, does not start `/renew_seed_lease`, and applies no local "
"expiration timer, but still sends `/put_seed` after successful or failed "
"use, including when transfer validation fails. Heartbeats report seed "
"liveness; they do not renew a receive lease. A present but invalid TTL is a "
"protocol error. When the header is present, RFork renews the lease at one "
"third of the TTL, clamped to 0.1–30 seconds; renewal failures are retried at"
" that cadence and do not stop inference, but the lease may still expire on "
"the planner side. A failed legacy `/put_seed` is retained as pending "
"bookkeeping and does not prevent native finalization; shutdown makes one "
"best-effort release attempt unless a release request is already in flight."
msgstr ""
"`LEASE_TTL_SEC` 是可选的响应头。缺少该响应头时，RFork 接受租约，不启动 "
"`/renew_seed_lease`，也不设置本地过期计时器，但仍会在成功或失败使用后发送 `/put_seed`（包括传输校验失败时）。心跳用于报告"
" seed 存活状态，不会续租接收租约。存在但无效的 TTL 属于协议错误。存在该响应头时，RFork 按 TTL 的三分之一续租，间隔限制在 "
"0.1–30 秒；续租失败会按该间隔重试，且不会停止推理，但租约仍可能在规划器侧过期。失败的旧版 `/put_seed` "
"会作为待处理记录保留，但不会阻止原生 finalize；关闭时会尽力执行一次释放，除非已有释放请求在途。"

msgid ""
"- RFork requires `YuanRong TransferEngine` at runtime. If the package is missing, RFork cannot initialize the transfer backend.\n"
"- A worker that is advertised as an RFork seed binds a seed HTTP listening port. With the default\n"
"  `rfork_seed_port_base=0`, the OS assigns the port. A nonzero base reserves adjacent main and draft slots for each\n"
"  worker; an occupied slot or a resolved port above `65535` falls back to OS assignment. Keep seed HTTP ports\n"
"  separate from the vLLM serving port, TransferEngine RPC port, and HIXL endpoint range. RFork is supported on\n"
"  Linux, and this port-conflict fallback follows Linux `EADDRINUSE` semantics.\n"
"- RFork transfer is bypassed entirely — the model loads through the default loader and no seed is advertised — under any of the configurations below. RFork registers live NPU weight memory and serves it to other instances, so it cannot be used when that memory may later be released or rewritten. The bypass is decided before any session or TransferEngine setup and is logged as `RFork transfer is disabled when <reason> is enabled; using the default model loader.`\n"
"    - **Sleep mode** (`enable_sleep_mode` on either the model config or `vllm_config.model_config`), because sleeping discards and reallocates weight storage.\n"
"    - **Online weight transfer** (`weight_transfer_config` is set), because weights can be replaced after loading.\n"
"    - **EPLB** (`--enable-eplb`), because asynchronous expert rearrangement rewrites expert weights and placement maps in place after the seed service starts.\n"
"- The static, recording, and legacy dynamic EPLB modes configured through `additional_config.eplb_config` (`expert_map_path`, `expert_map_record_path`, `dynamic_eplb`) belonged to Model Runner V1 and have been removed. They no longer take effect, so they neither enable EPLB nor bypass RFork.\n"
"- Falling back to the default loader requires releasing the RFork seed service and registered memory first. RFork makes at most two cleanup attempts (`FALLBACK_CLEANUP_MAX_ATTEMPTS`, currently 2), with a short backoff before the second attempt, and only then reclaims memory and reruns the default loader. A pending legacy `/put_seed` for an unpublished receiver does not block native finalization, but if required local cleanup still fails, tensor owners remain pinned and RFork raises rather than allocating a second copy of the model; a session that already reached the finalized state raises as well. Both cases abort startup instead of degrading to a slow load.\n"
"- The example [`rfork_planner.py`](https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm-ascend/blob/main/examples/rfork/rfork_planner.py) is only a simple mock implementation. If you need stronger scheduling, capacity management, or production-grade availability behavior, implement your own planner based on the RFork seed protocol. Its unauthenticated `GET /debug/snapshot` endpoint lists every registered `seed_key` and every active lease `USER_ID`; those IDs authorize lease renewal and release, so anything that can reach the mock planner can learn cluster keys and disrupt active allocations. Keep it reachable only inside the trusted network segment (see the [FAQ](#faq)).\n"
"- The planner protocol headers `SEED_REFCNT` and `SEED_RANK` carry no scheduling meaning, but they are not optional on the wire today:\n"
"    - `SEED_REFCNT` is always sent as `0` on advertisement and is ignored for capacity decisions (seed capacity is controlled by planner configuration). A planner must still accept the header.\n"
"    - `SEED_RANK` remains a **required** field. RFork rejects a `/get_seed` response that omits it or carries a negative value, and sends it on every seed advertisement, lease renewal, lease release, and seed removal request. A planner must echo it back on `/get_seed` and accept it on the other routes. What is deprecated is using it for compatibility decisions: it duplicates the `tp_rank` already encoded in the seed key, so a planner must match on the seed key alone and treat `SEED_RANK` as an opaque part of the seed's identity tuple.\n"
"- Each heartbeat checks that the seed service thread is still running; it does not send a keyed HTTP health probe on every\n"
"  interval. A keyed `/health_check_with_key` request is issued only while the service starts, so a thread that stays alive\n"
"  while its HTTP listener is unresponsive can still keep heartbeating. Monitor the advertised seed port at the network\n"
"  level if that distinction matters. If the thread exits, RFork stops sending heartbeats and\n"
"  attempts to withdraw the advertisement when the planner supports removal. A heartbeat failure alone does not stop\n"
"  the metadata service; shutdown or fallback cleanup handles that teardown. If removal is unsupported or unknown, RFork\n"
"  retains the published seed's registered memory and storage owner until a later withdrawal is confirmed and native\n"
"  cleanup succeeds, or the process exits, while keeping the loaded model available for inference.\n"
"- Temporary planner outages do not stop inference. Retryable initial advertisements and lease releases continue in the\n"
"  background. Supported removal retries are bounded or happen during later cleanup; other removal failures keep the HTTP\n"
"  service and registered memory available for retry. Permanent planner rejections prevent seed promotion. Outage logs are\n"
"  limited to the first failure, periodic summaries, and recovery events.\n"
"- Validate transfer accuracy and the logical-payload contract for newly supported NPU formats on the intended NPU and\n"
"  model combination; CPU tests cannot establish NPU storage correctness. This qualification is required when adding a\n"
"  format, but it is not a runtime requirement to copy allocator or descriptor padding outside a tensor's declared payload."
msgstr ""
"- RFork 运行时需要 `YuanRong TransferEngine`。如果缺少该软件包，RFork 无法初始化传输后端。\n"
"- 被发布为 RFork seed 的 worker 会绑定一个 seed HTTP 监听端口。默认 `rfork_seed_port_base=0` 时由操作系统分配端口。设置非零基端口时，每个 worker 会为主模型和 draft 模型预留相邻槽位；如果端口已被占用，或计算出的端口超过 `65535`，则回退到操作系统分配的端口。seed HTTP 端口应与 vLLM 服务端口、TransferEngine RPC 端口和 HIXL 端点范围分开。RFork 仅在 Linux 上受支持，端口冲突回退遵循 Linux `EADDRINUSE` 语义。\n"
"- 在以下任一配置下，RFork 传输都会被完全旁路：模型通过默认加载器加载，也不会发布 seed。RFork 会注册正在使用的 NPU 权重内存并为其他实例提供服务，因此当这部分内存之后可能被释放或改写时，不能使用 RFork。旁路判断发生在创建 session 或 TransferEngine 之前，日志为 `RFork transfer is disabled when <reason> is enabled; using the default model loader.`\n"
"    - **睡眠模式**（模型配置或 `vllm_config.model_config` 中的 `enable_sleep_mode`），因为睡眠会丢弃并重新分配权重存储。\n"
"    - **在线权重传输**（设置了 `weight_transfer_config`），因为权重可能在加载后被替换。\n"
"    - **EPLB**（`--enable-eplb`），因为异步专家重排会在 seed 服务启动后原地改写专家权重和放置映射。\n"
"- 通过 `additional_config.eplb_config` 配置的静态、录制和旧版动态 EPLB 模式（`expert_map_path`、`expert_map_record_path`、`dynamic_eplb`）属于 Model Runner V1，已被移除。这些字段不再生效，既不会启用 EPLB，也不会触发 RFork 旁路。\n"
"- 回退到默认加载器前，必须先释放 RFork seed 服务和已注册的内存。RFork 最多执行两次清理尝试（`FALLBACK_CLEANUP_MAX_ATTEMPTS`，当前为 2），两次尝试之间会短暂退避，然后才回收内存并重新运行默认加载器。对于尚未发布 seed 的接收端，待处理的旧版 `/put_seed` 不会阻止原生 finalize；但如果必要的本地清理仍然失败，张量所有者仍被保留，RFork 会抛出异常，拒绝在旧权重仍被固定时分配第二份模型；已经进入 finalized 状态的 session 也会抛出异常。这两种情况都会中止启动，而不会降级为较慢的加载。\n"
"- [`rfork_planner.py`](https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm-ascend/blob/main/examples/rfork/rfork_planner.py) 只是一个简单的模拟实现。如果需要更强的调度、容量管理或生产级可用性行为，请根据 RFork seed 协议实现自己的规划器。其无鉴权的 `GET /debug/snapshot` 端点会列出所有已注册的 `seed_key` 和所有活动租约的 `USER_ID`；这些 ID 可用于续租和释放租约，因此任何能访问该 mock planner 的对象都能获取集群 key 并干扰活动分配。请确保它仅在可信网络段内可达（详见 FAQ）。\n"
"- 规划器协议头 `SEED_REFCNT` 和 `SEED_RANK` 不承载调度语义，但目前在协议线上都不是可选字段：\n"
"    - 发布 seed 时 `SEED_REFCNT` 始终发送为 `0`，不会用于容量决策（seed 容量由规划器配置控制）。规划器仍必须接受此请求头。\n"
"    - `SEED_RANK` 仍是**必需**字段。如果 `/get_seed` 响应缺少该字段或其值为负数，RFork 会拒绝该响应；在发布 seed、续租、释放租约和删除 seed 的请求中都会发送该字段。规划器必须在 `/get_seed` 响应中原样返回，并在其他路由中接受它。已弃用的是将其用于兼容性决策：它重复了 seed key 中已经编码的 `tp_rank`，因此规划器应仅按 seed key 匹配，并将 `SEED_RANK` 视为 seed 身份元组中的不透明字段。\n"
"- 每次心跳只检查 seed 服务线程是否仍在运行，不会在每个间隔发送带 key 的 HTTP 健康探测。带 key 的 `/health_check_with_key` 请求仅在服务启动期间发送，因此线程仍存活但 HTTP 监听无响应时，心跳仍可能成功。若需要区分这两种情况，请在网络层面监控已发布的 seed 端口。如果线程退出，RFork 会停止发送心跳，并在规划器支持删除时尝试撤销该 seed 广告。单次心跳故障本身不会停止元数据服务；该服务由关闭或回退清理流程处理。如果删除不受支持或状态未知，RFork 会保留已发布 seed 的已注册内存和存储所有者，直到之后确认撤销且原生清理成功，或进程退出，同时保持已加载模型可继续推理。\n"
"- 临时的规划器故障不会停止推理。可重试的初始发布和租约释放会在后台继续。受支持的删除只会在有界重试或后续清理中重试；其他删除失败会保留 HTTP 服务和已注册内存，以便重试。永久性的规划器拒绝则会阻止 seed 晋升。故障日志仅记录首次失败、周期性摘要和恢复事件。\n"
"- 对于新支持的 NPU 格式，应在目标 NPU 和模型组合上验证传输准确性及逻辑负载契约；CPU 测试无法证明 NPU 存储的正确性。新增格式时必须进行这项验证，但这不表示运行时需要复制张量声明负载之外的分配器或描述符填充。"
